L["does not exist (or its existence is withheld)"] = "no existe (o se oculta su existencia)"
L["withheld: %s"] = "sin acceso: %s"
L["this buff is not readable here"] = "este beneficio no se puede leer aquí"
L["%s has no unit token right now, so {unit} cannot be filled"] = "%s no tiene identificador de unidad ahora mismo, así que {unit} no se puede rellenar"
L["1 minute"] = "1 minuto"
L["%d minutes"] = "%d minutos"
L["snoozed for %s, until %s -- though Manners is switched off, so no prompt appears either way."] = "en pausa durante %s, hasta las %s -- aunque Manners está desactivado, así que el aviso no aparece de todos modos."
L["snoozed for %s, until %s. In a fight the prompt stays as the fight found it, and follows the snooze once this one ends. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "en pausa durante %s, hasta las %s. En combate, el aviso se queda como estaba al empezar el combate, y sigue la pausa cuando este termine. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r la termina antes."
L["snoozed for %s, until %s. The prompt is unlocked, so it stays up to be dragged and casts nothing; once you lock it, it stays away until the snooze ends. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "en pausa durante %s, hasta las %s. El aviso está desbloqueado, así que sigue en pantalla para que lo arrastres y no lanza nada; cuando lo bloquees, no aparecerá hasta que termine la pausa. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r la termina antes."
L["snoozed for %s -- no prompt until %s. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "en pausa durante %s -- sin aviso hasta las %s. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r la termina antes."
L["the snooze is over, but Manners is switched off -- |cffffd100/manners on|r to see the prompt again."] = "la pausa terminó, pero Manners está desactivado -- usa |cffffd100/manners on|r para volver a ver el aviso."
L["the snooze is over -- the prompt can appear again once this fight ends."] = "la pausa terminó -- el aviso podrá volver a aparecer cuando termine este combate."
L["the snooze is over -- the prompt can appear again."] = "la pausa terminó -- el aviso puede volver a aparecer."
L["not snoozed -- the prompt is free to appear."] = "no hay pausa -- el aviso puede aparecer libremente."
L["there is nothing to import -- paste a settings string that starts with MNR1:."] = "no hay nada que importar -- pega un texto de configuración que empiece por MNR1:."
L["that is not a Manners settings string -- one starts with MNR1:."] = "eso no es un texto de configuración de Manners -- esos empiezan por MNR1:."
L["that is far longer than any Manners settings string, so it was not read."] = "eso es mucho más largo que cualquier texto de configuración de Manners, así que no se leyó."
L["that string was made by a newer version of Manners -- update the addon to read it."] = "ese texto lo creó una versión más reciente de Manners -- actualiza el accesorio para leerlo."
L["that string is incomplete or has been changed -- copy it again in one piece, and paste a long one into the box under Share as text on the Profiles tab of the options."] = "ese texto está incompleto o se modificó -- vuelve a copiarlo entero, y pega uno largo en el cuadro de Compartir como texto, en la pestaña Perfiles de las opciones."
L["that string is damaged -- part of it is not a setting Manners can read. Copy it again in one piece."] = "ese texto está dañado -- una parte no es una opción que Manners pueda leer. Vuelve a copiarlo entero."
L["that string gives %s a value it cannot have, so nothing was changed."] = "ese texto le da a %s un valor que no puede tener, así que no se cambió nada."
L["settings imported -- every one of them is the default."] = "configuración importada -- todas las opciones tienen su valor predeterminado."
L["settings imported -- 1 differs from the defaults."] = "configuración importada -- 1 opción difiere de los valores predeterminados."
L["settings imported -- %d differ from the defaults."] = "configuración importada -- %d opciones difieren de los valores predeterminados."
L["1 setting from a newer version of Manners was left out."] = "Se omitió 1 opción de una versión más reciente de Manners."
L["%d settings from a newer version of Manners were left out."] = "Se omitieron %d opciones de una versión más reciente de Manners."
L["The string had speaking a line when you buff switched on. That is left off, because it talks to other players: switch it on under What I say if you want it."] = "El texto tenía activado decir una frase al dar un beneficio. Se deja desactivado, porque habla a otros jugadores: actívalo en la pestaña Qué digo si lo quieres."
L["What you say when you buff, and where, is kept as you had it, because you have speaking switched on."] = "Lo que dices al dar un beneficio, y dónde, se queda como lo tenías, porque tienes activada la opción Decir algo."
L["The prompt's look changes when this fight ends."] = "El aspecto del aviso cambiará cuando termine este combate."
L["|cffffd100/manners import undo|r puts your old settings back."] = "|cffffd100/manners import undo|r restaura tu configuración anterior."
L["nothing to undo -- no settings have been imported on this profile this session."] = "no hay nada que deshacer -- no se importó ninguna configuración en este perfil durante esta sesión."
L["nothing to undo on this profile -- the last import was made on profile %s. Switch back to it to undo it."] = "no hay nada que deshacer en este perfil -- la última importación se hizo en el perfil %s. Vuelve a él para deshacerla."
L["nothing to undo on this profile -- the last import was made on another one. Switch back to it to undo it."] = "no hay nada que deshacer en este perfil -- la última importación se hizo en otro. Vuelve a ese perfil para deshacerla."
L["your settings from before the import could not be read back, so they were not restored."] = "no se pudo volver a leer tu configuración de antes de la importación, así que no se restauró."
L["your settings from before the import are back. The prompt's look changes when this fight ends."] = "volvió tu configuración de antes de la importación. El aspecto del aviso cambiará cuando termine este combate."
L["your settings from before the import are back."] = "volvió tu configuración de antes de la importación."
L["Everyday"] = "Uso diario"
L["Setting it up"] = "Puesta en marcha"
L["Sharing settings"] = "Compartir configuración"
L["When something is wrong"] = "Cuando algo falla"
L["open the options window"] = "abrir la ventana de opciones"
L["turn the addon on"] = "activar el accesorio"
L["turn it off"] = "desactivarlo"
L["hide the prompt for a while -- 15 minutes unless you say"] = "ocultar el aviso un rato -- 15 minutos si no indicas otra cosa"
L["preview the prompt with a mock candidate"] = "ver una vista previa del aviso con un candidato de prueba"
L["the favour ledger: who buffed you, what you gave back, and who you buffed"] = "el registro de favores: quién te dio un beneficio, qué devolviste y a quién le diste uno"
L["what this addon does, and the one thing it needs from you"] = "qué hace este accesorio y lo único que necesita de ti"
L["make a /click macro for your action bar"] = "crear una macro /click para tu barra de acción"
L["unlock the prompt so it can be dragged"] = "desbloquear el aviso para poder arrastrarlo"
L["lock it again -- an unlocked prompt never casts"] = "volver a bloquearlo -- un aviso desbloqueado nunca lanza nada"
L["list who is never offered anything, or put somebody on that list"] = "ver a quién nunca se le ofrece nada, o añadir a alguien a esa lista"
L["take somebody off the never-offer list"] = "quitar a alguien de la lista de excluidos"
L["switch handing your target back after buffing on or off"] = "activar o desactivar la recuperación de tu objetivo después de dar un beneficio"
L["switch the chat lines about who buffed you on or off"] = "activar o desactivar los mensajes de chat sobre quién te dio un beneficio"
L["copy these settings as one line of text"] = "copiar esta configuración como una sola línea de texto"
L["use settings somebody exported, or undo the last import"] = "usar la configuración que exportó alguien, o deshacer la última importación"
L["what your class and this build allow"] = "qué permiten tu clase y esta versión"
L["the last few things that broke"] = "las últimas cosas que fallaron"
L["tools for testing the addon on this client: the click log, try, look and forms"] = "herramientas para probar el accesorio en este cliente: el registro de clics, try, look y forms"
L["log what the button does when clicked"] = "registrar qué hace el botón al hacer clic en él"
L["run any macro text from the prompt"] = "ejecutar cualquier texto de macro desde el aviso"
L["dump every API answer for a unit"] = "volcar todas las respuestas de la API para una unidad"
L["example macros to try"] = "macros de ejemplo para probar"
L["Manners commands:"] = "Comandos de Manners:"
L["|cffffd100/mnr|r works in place of |cffffd100/manners|r in all of them."] = "|cffffd100/mnr|r sirve en lugar de |cffffd100/manners|r en todos ellos."
L["try cleared -- the normal cast takes effect when this fight ends; until then a press runs the macro already on the button."] = "prueba borrada -- el lanzamiento normal se aplica cuando termine este combate; hasta entonces, una pulsación ejecuta la macro que ya está en el botón."
L["try cleared -- back to the normal cast."] = "prueba borrada -- vuelve el lanzamiento normal."
L["try armed: |cff80ff80%s|r"] = "prueba preparada: |cff80ff80%s|r"
L["|cffff8080not armed for now:|r %s."] = "|cffff8080sin preparar por ahora:|r %s."
L["expands to: |cffffffff%s|r"] = "se expande a: |cffffffff%s|r"
L["%d characters -- %d over the %d a macro body holds. The client will cut it, and what runs is not what is printed above."] = "%d caracteres -- %d más de los %d que admite el cuerpo de una macro. El cliente la recortará, y lo que se ejecute no será lo que aparece arriba."
L["It takes effect when this fight ends; until then a press runs the macro already on the button. |cffffd100/manners try|r with nothing clears it."] = "Se aplica cuando termine este combate; hasta entonces, una pulsación ejecuta la macro que ya está en el botón. |cffffd100/manners try|r sin nada más la borra."
L["The prompt arms it once they have one. |cffffd100/manners try|r with nothing clears it."] = "El aviso la preparará cuando esa persona tenga uno. |cffffd100/manners try|r sin nada más la borra."
L["Click the prompt to run it. |cffffd100/manners try|r with nothing clears it."] = "Haz clic en el aviso para ejecutarla. |cffffd100/manners try|r sin nada más la borra."
L["Targeting forms, for /manners try:"] = "Formas de selección de objetivo, para /manners try:"
L["(on yourself)"] = "(sobre ti)"
L["Tokens: |cffffd100{unit} {name} {aim} {first} {spell} {id}|r. {name} is what a debt is filed under, {aim} is what a targeting line wants. Use \\n for a new line."] = "Comodines: |cffffd100{unit} {name} {aim} {first} {spell} {id}|r. {name} es el nombre con el que se anota una deuda; {aim} es lo que pide una línea de selección de objetivo. Usa \\n para una línea nueva."
L["the favour ledger did not load -- reinstalling Manners should bring it back."] = "el registro de favores no se cargó -- reinstalar Manners debería recuperarlo."
L["unlocked -- it can be dragged once this fight ends; until then a press still casts what the fight froze. Then |cffffd100/manners lock|r."] = "desbloqueado -- se podrá arrastrar cuando termine este combate; hasta entonces, una pulsación sigue lanzando lo que congeló el combate. Después, |cffffd100/manners lock|r."
L["unlocked -- it can be dragged once this fight ends; nothing is armed meanwhile. Then |cffffd100/manners lock|r."] = "desbloqueado -- se podrá arrastrar cuando termine este combate; mientras tanto no hay nada preparado. Después, |cffffd100/manners lock|r."
L["unlocked -- drag the prompt, then |cffffd100/manners lock|r."] = "desbloqueado -- arrastra el aviso y luego usa |cffffd100/manners lock|r."
L["unlocked, but the addon is |cffff8080off|r so there is no prompt to drag -- |cffffd100/manners on|r first."] = "desbloqueado, pero el accesorio está |cffff8080desactivado|r, así que no hay aviso que arrastrar -- primero usa |cffffd100/manners on|r."
L["locked."] = "bloqueado."
L["hand your target back after buffing: |cff00ff00on|r -- takes effect when this fight ends; until then a press runs the macro already on the button."] = "recuperar tu objetivo después de dar un beneficio: |cff00ff00activado|r -- se aplica cuando termine este combate; hasta entonces, una pulsación ejecuta la macro que ya está en el botón."
L["hand your target back after buffing: |cffff0000off|r -- takes effect when this fight ends; until then a press runs the macro already on the button."] = "recuperar tu objetivo después de dar un beneficio: |cffff0000desactivado|r -- se aplica cuando termine este combate; hasta entonces, una pulsación ejecuta la macro que ya está en el botón."
L["hand your target back after buffing: |cff00ff00on|r"] = "recuperar tu objetivo después de dar un beneficio: |cff00ff00activado|r"
L["hand your target back after buffing: |cffff0000off|r"] = "recuperar tu objetivo después de dar un beneficio: |cffff0000desactivado|r"
L["click logging: |cff00ff00on|r"] = "registro de clics: |cff00ff00activado|r"
L["click logging: |cffff0000off|r"] = "registro de clics: |cffff0000desactivado|r"
L["verbose: |cff00ff00on|r -- a line in your own chat when somebody buffs you, when a favour is counted as repaid, and when a click fails, is skipped, or leaves somebody owed"] = "modo detallado: |cff00ff00activado|r -- una línea en tu propio chat cuando alguien te da un beneficio, cuando un favor se da por devuelto, y cuando un clic falla, se salta a alguien o deja un favor pendiente"
L["verbose: |cffff0000off|r"] = "modo detallado: |cffff0000desactivado|r"
L["enabled."] = "activado."
L["disabled."] = "desactivado."
L["nobody is on your never-offer list. Shift-right-click the prompt to put whoever it is showing on it."] = "no hay nadie en tu lista de excluidos. Haz Mayús + clic derecho en el aviso para añadir a quien esté mostrando."
L["never offered anything unless they buff you: %s"] = "nunca se les ofrece nada salvo que te den un beneficio: %s"
L["say who: |cffffd100/manners allow Name|r. |cffffd100/manners never|r lists everybody on the list."] = "di a quién: |cffffd100/manners allow Name|r. |cffffd100/manners never|r muestra a todos los de la lista."
L["|cffffffff%s|r can be offered again."] = "A |cffffffff%s|r se le puede volver a ofrecer algo."
L["nobody called %s is on your never-offer list."] = "no hay nadie con el nombre %s en tu lista de excluidos."
L["snooze takes a number of minutes from 1 to %d, or off -- for example |cffffd100/manners snooze 15|r or |cffffd100/manners snooze 1h|r."] = "la pausa admite un número de minutos de 1 a %d, u off -- por ejemplo |cffffd100/manners snooze 15|r o |cffffd100/manners snooze 1h|r."
L["your settings are in the box under |cffffd100Share as text|r on the Profiles tab of the options -- click in it, select all and copy."] = "tu configuración está en el cuadro de |cffffd100Compartir como texto|r, en la pestaña Perfiles de las opciones -- haz clic en él, selecciona todo y cópialo."
L["this string is too long to be imported back -- a very long phrase box under What I say is the usual cause. Shorten it if you want to share these settings."] = "este texto es demasiado largo para volver a importarlo -- suele deberse a un cuadro de frases muy largo en la pestaña Qué digo. Acórtalo si quieres compartir esta configuración."
L["paste the settings string into the box under |cffffd100Share as text|r on the Profiles tab, or type |cffffd100/manners import|r followed by it."] = "pega el texto de configuración en el cuadro de |cffffd100Compartir como texto|r, en la pestaña Perfiles, o escribe |cffffd100/manners import|r seguido del texto."
L["type |cffffd100/manners import|r followed by a settings string."] = "escribe |cffffd100/manners import|r seguido de un texto de configuración."
L["Tools for testing Manners on this client:"] = "Herramientas para probar Manners en este cliente:"
L["nothing has broken this session."] = "nada falló en esta sesión."
L["|cffffd100the last %d of %d|r |cff808080(%d kept)|r:"] = "|cffffd100los últimos %d de %d|r |cff808080(%d guardados)|r:"
L["|cffffd100the last %d of %d|r:"] = "|cffffd100los últimos %d de %d|r:"
L["Flavour.lua did not load -- check the toc's file list"] = "Flavour.lua no se cargó -- revisa la lista de archivos del toc"
L["|cffff4040this client has never heard of %s|r -- Manners has the wrong spell ids for %s on %s. Please report this line."] = "|cffff4040este cliente no conoce %s|r -- Manners tiene mal los ID de hechizo de %s en %s. Por favor, reporta esta línea."
L["owes returning: |cffffffff%s|r (%ds left, buffed you %ds ago)"] = "favor pendiente: |cffffffff%s|r (quedan %d s, te dio un beneficio hace %d s)"
L["not watching for favours -- Manners is switched off."] = "no se vigilan los favores -- Manners está desactivado."
L["not watching for favours -- |cffffd100People who buff me|r is switched off."] = "no se vigilan los favores -- |cffffd100Quienes me dan un beneficio|r está desactivado."
L["nobody has buffed you recently."] = "nadie te dio un beneficio últimamente."
L["|cffff8080own buffs: last scan not believed (%s)|r -- %d read, baseline %d"] = "|cffff8080beneficios propios: último escaneo no fiable (%s)|r -- %d leídos, referencia %d"
L["|cffffd100own buffs: baseline not settled|r -- %d read, waiting for a second scan to agree"] = "|cffffd100beneficios propios: referencia sin fijar|r -- %d leídos, esperando a que un segundo escaneo coincida"
L["own buffs: %d read, baseline %d"] = "beneficios propios: %d leídos, referencia %d"
L["thank with an emote: |cff00ff00on|r"] = "dar las gracias con una emoción: |cff00ff00activado|r"
L["thank with an emote: |cffff0000off|r"] = "dar las gracias con una emoción: |cffff0000desactivado|r"
L["last thanked: |cffffffff%s|r, %ds ago (the game answered %s)"] = "último agradecimiento: |cffffffff%s|r, hace %d s (el juego respondió %s)"
L["last not thanked: |cffffffff%s|r, %ds ago (%s)"] = "último agradecimiento no dado: |cffffffff%s|r, hace %d s (%s)"
L["switched OFF on this profile -- nothing is recorded or offered; /manners on"] = "está DESACTIVADO en este perfil -- no se registra ni se ofrece nada; /manners on"
L["prompt is UNLOCKED -- it will not buff anyone until you /manners lock"] = "el aviso está DESBLOQUEADO -- no dará ningún beneficio a nadie hasta que uses /manners lock"
L["|cffffd100snoozed until %s|r -- no prompt until then; /manners snooze off ends it"] = "|cffffd100en pausa hasta las %s|r -- sin aviso hasta entonces; /manners snooze off la termina"
L["|cffffd100mounted|r -- Not while mounted keeps the prompt away until you get off"] = "|cffffd100sobre una montura|r -- la opción Ocultar al ir montado mantiene el aviso oculto hasta que desmontes"
L["|cffffd100saving mana|r -- until you are back to %d%% mana, only people who buffed you or asked are offered"] = "|cffffd100ahorrando maná|r -- hasta que vuelvas al %d%% de maná, solo se ofrece a quienes te dieron un beneficio o lo pidieron"
L["|cffffd100ready check|r -- your party or raid comes first until the pull"] = "|cffffd100comprobación de disponibilidad|r -- tu grupo o banda va primero hasta que empiece el combate"
L["|cffffd100raid groups|r -- in a raid, only groups %s are offered unasked"] = "|cffffd100grupos de banda|r -- en una banda, sin que lo pidan, solo se ofrece a los grupos %s"
L["|cffffd100raid groups|r -- every group is unticked, so in a raid nobody is offered unasked"] = "|cffffd100grupos de banda|r -- todos los grupos están desmarcados, así que en una banda no se ofrece a nadie sin que lo pida"
L["|cffff8080/manners try is armed:|r %s -- clear it with a bare /manners try"] = "|cffff8080prueba de /manners try preparada:|r %s -- bórrala con /manners try sin nada más"
L["queue now: %d"] = "cola ahora: %d"
L["queue if switched on: %d"] = "cola si estuviera activado: %d"
L["there is no |cffffd100/manners %s|r -- did you mean |cffffd100/manners %s|r? |cffffd100/manners help|r lists them all."] = "no existe |cffffd100/manners %s|r -- ¿quisiste decir |cffffd100/manners %s|r? |cffffd100/manners help|r los muestra todos."
L["there is no |cffffd100/manners %s|r -- did you mean |cffffd100/manners %s|r? |cffffd100/manners dev|r lists the testing tools."] = "no existe |cffffd100/manners %s|r -- ¿quisiste decir |cffffd100/manners %s|r? |cffffd100/manners dev|r muestra las herramientas de prueba."
L["Thank ye kindly, {name}! First round's on me when we're back at the forge."] = "¡Gracias de corazón, {name}! La primera ronda la pago yo en la forja."
L["Much obliged, {name}. Ye've a friend in the mountain now."] = "Te debo una, {name}. Ya tienes amigos en la montaña."
L["Thank ye, {name}! I'd have been fine without it, mind. But thank ye."] = "¡Gracias, {name}! Me las habría arreglado sin esto, ojo. Pero gracias."
L["Bless ye, {name}! I'd hug ye, but ye'd be needin' a healer after."] = "¡Bendiciones, {name}! Te abrazaría, pero luego te haría falta un sanador."
L["Paid back already, {name}. Quicker than I've ever settled a bar tab."] = "Deuda saldada, {name}. Jamás pagué una cuenta de taberna tan rápido."
L["I'll tell this at the Thunderbrew like ye saved me life, {name}. Thank ye!"] = "En la Cebatruenos diré que me salvaste la vida, {name}. ¡Gracias!"
L["Grand, {name}! I'd carve ye a statue, but this is quicker."] = "¡Genial, {name}! Te tallaría una estatua, pero esto es más rápido."
L["The Titans made us of stone, {name}, but that still touched me. Thank ye."] = "Los titanes nos tallaron en piedra, {name}, pero esto me ablandó. Gracias."
L["Aye, {name}, ye only had to ask. Hold still now, like a good anvil."] = "¡Claro, {name}, bastaba con pedirlo! Firme como un buen yunque."
L["Say no more, {name}. Stone and steel, here it comes."] = "Ni una palabra más, {name}. Piedra y acero, ¡ahí va!"
L["Ask a dwarf fer help, {name}, and ye'll get it. Loudly."] = "Pídele ayuda a un enano, {name}, y la tendrás. A gritos."
L["Right, {name}. Brace yerself; I do everything like I'm swingin' a hammer."] = "A ver, {name}. Agárrate, que yo todo lo hago a martillazos."
L["Aye, {name}, and a story about it ye didn't ask fer. Where to begin..."] = "Claro, {name}, y de regalo una historia que no pediste. Pues verás..."
L["One {buff}, pulled fresh like a proper pint, {name}."] = "{buff} de barril, con su espuma y todo, {name}."
L["Done, {name}. Dwarven work: over-built, under-priced and guaranteed."] = "Hecho, {name}. Trabajo enano: macizo, barato y con garantía."
L["Here, {name}, a wee somethin' to keep ye on yer feet. Wee, like me."] = "Toma, {name}, un detallito pa' que no flaquees. Chiquito, como yo."
L["Off ye go, {name}, steady as the mountain."] = "Andando, {name}, firme como la montaña."
L["Here, {name}. Ale's for after; this is for before."] = "Toma, {name}. La cerveza, pa' después; esto, pa' antes."
L["Magni turned to diamond fer the cause, {name}. This is the cheaper option."] = "Magni se volvió diamante por la causa, {name}. Esto sale más barato."
L["A dwarf's got yer back, {name}. Well, yer knees. Close enough."] = "Un enano te cubre la espalda, {name}. Bueno, las rodillas. Casi."
L["If a trogg bothers ye, {name}, tell it a dwarf sent ye. Then run."] = "Si un trogg te molesta, {name}, dile que te manda un enano. Y luego corre."
L["If it wears off, {name}, give it a good thump. That's how we fix everything."] = "Si se pasa el efecto, {name}, dale un buen golpe. Así lo arreglamos todo."
L["Take this, {name}. I'd give ye some stubbornness too, but I'm usin' all mine."] = "Toma, {name}. También te daría algo de terquedad, pero la uso toda yo."
L["Stone and hammer keep ye, cousin {name}!"] = "¡Piedra y martillo te guarden, pariente {name}!"
L["Three Hammers, one round, cousin {name}!"] = "¡Tres Martillos, una ronda, pariente {name}!"
L["Yer cousin's cousin married mine, {name}, I'd wager. It's a small mountain."] = "Apuesto a que somos primos de primos, {name}. La montaña es un pañuelo."
L["Two dwarves together, {name}. Pity whatever's standin' in our way."] = "Dos enanos juntos, {name}. Pobre del que se nos ponga delante."
L["Stand behind me, {name}. Aye, I know. Crouch a bit."] = "Ponte detrás de mí, {name}. Ya, ya lo sé. Agáchate un poco."
L["Right, {name}: I take the front, ye take the loot, and we argue after."] = "Bien, {name}: yo voy delante, tú te llevas el botín y luego discutimos."
L["If I start singin', {name}, the fight's gone well. Or very badly."] = "Si empiezo a cantar, {name}, es que el combate fue bien. O muy mal."
L["Dwarves never leave a mate behind, {name}. Nor a keg. Mates first, mind."] = "Un enano no abandona a un amigo, {name}. Ni un barril. Primero el amigo, ¿eh?"
L["Beards out, {name}! Them without beards, look fierce. It's nearly as good."] = "¡Barbas al viento, {name}! Sin barba, pon cara feroz. Casi sirve igual."
L["Mornin', {name}! Too early for ale. Almost. Have this first."] = "¡Buenos días, {name}! Temprano pa' la cerveza. Casi. Toma esto antes."
L["Up with the forge fires, {name}! A dwarf's day starts with a hammer and this."] = "¡En pie con las forjas, {name}! El día de un enano empieza con un martillo y esto."
L["Early, {name}? Nonsense. The mine's been open two hours. Here."] = "¿Temprano, {name}? Qué va. La mina abrió hace dos horas. Toma."
L["My thanks, {name}. Let me return the kindness before a bard gets it wrong."] = "Gracias, {name}. Deja que te lo devuelva antes de que un bardo lo cuente mal."
L["Kindly done, {name}. Let no one say we forget a friend."] = "Muy amable, {name}. Que nadie diga que olvidamos a un amigo."
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd knight you, but apparently I 'need permission'."] = "Gracias, {name}. Te daría un título, pero dicen que 'necesito permiso'."
L["Repaid on the spot, {name}. In Stormwind that'd take three forms and a stamp."] = "Pagado al instante, {name}. En Ventormenta pedirían tres formularios y un sello."
L["Thanks, {name}. I'd pay in gold, but Stormwind still owes the stonemasons."] = "Gracias, {name}. Te pagaría en oro, pero Ventormenta aún les debe a los canteros."
L["Much obliged, {name}. Mother said always return a kindness. And the dish."] = "Mil gracias, {name}. Mi madre decía: devuelve siempre los favores. Y el plato."
L["Thank you, {name}. Consider the scales balanced, by royal decree. Mine."] = "Gracias, {name}. Quedamos en paz, por real decreto. El mío."
L["You shame me, {name}; I should have thought of it first. Allow me."] = "Me dejas en evidencia, {name}; debí pensarlo yo primero. Permíteme."
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still and look heroic; it helps the bards."] = "Claro, {name}. No te muevas y pon pose heroica; ayuda a los bardos."
L["Right away, {name}. Keep your shield high."] = "Enseguida, {name}. Mantén el escudo en alto."
L["More work? Gladly, {name}. It beats the lumber mill."] = "¿Más trabajo? Con gusto, {name}. Mejor que el aserradero."
L["Of course, {name}. Humans excel at helping and overpromising. This is helping."] = "Claro, {name}. Los humanos ayudamos mucho y prometemos más. Esto es ayudar."
L["Certainly, {name}. Humans are quick learners; I learned this one yesterday."] = "Desde luego, {name}. Los humanos aprendemos rápido: este lo aprendí ayer."
L["Hold still, {name}, like a statue in the Valley of Heroes. You'd fit right in."] = "No te muevas, {name}, como una estatua del Valle de los Héroes. Encajarías."
L["Right away, {name}. The Light helps those who ask. So do I, and I'm quicker."] = "Enseguida, {name}. La Luz ayuda a quien se lo pide. Yo también, y más rápido."
L["The road ahead is long, {name}. This won't shorten it, but it'll help."] = "Te espera un largo camino, {name}. Esto no lo acorta, pero ayuda."
L["Fair winds and following seas, {name}."] = "Buen viento y buena mar, {name}."
L["Take this, {name}. Elves have centuries to be generous; I've got fifty years."] = "Toma, {name}. Los elfos tienen siglos para ser generosos; yo, cincuenta años."
L["A little something, {name}. Don't tell the guards; they'll all want one."] = "Un detallito, {name}. Que no se enteren los guardias, que todos querrán uno."
L["Here, {name}. If a kobold asks, you don't have a candle."] = "Toma, {name}. Si un kóbold pregunta, tú no tienes ninguna vela."
L["For you, {name}. A human gift: well meant, hastily made, surprisingly sturdy."] = "Para ti, {name}. Un regalo humano: con cariño, con prisa y duro de pelar."
L["Mind the murlocs, {name}. Take this; I've seen what they do to a picnic."] = "Ojo con los múrlocs, {name}. Toma; sé lo que le hacen a un pícnic."
L["Every road needs a hero, {name}. Today it's me, apparently. Take this."] = "Todo camino necesita un héroe, {name}. Hoy me toca a mí, por lo visto. Toma."
L["Arathor's children stand together, {name}."] = "Los hijos de Arathor, siempre unidos, {name}."
L["A fellow human, {name}! Quick, let's found a kingdom before lunch."] = "¡Sangre humana, {name}! Rápido, fundemos un reino antes de comer."
L["Stormwind or Boralus, {name}, we'll both complain about the weather."] = "Ventormenta o Boralus, {name}: da igual, nos quejaremos del tiempo."
L["Human to human, {name}: no, I don't know why everything happens to us either."] = "De humano a humano, {name}: no, yo tampoco sé por qué todo nos pasa a nosotros."
L["Keep close, {name}. Humans have always won by outnumbering things."] = "No te alejes, {name}. Los humanos siempre ganamos por ser más."
L["Stay in formation, {name}. We haven't got one, but stay in it anyway."] = "Mantén la formación, {name}. No tenemos ninguna, pero mantenla igual."
L["I'll draw up a plan, {name}, and then we can all ignore it together."] = "Haré un plan, {name}, y luego lo ignoramos todos juntos."
L["Every hero in the songs had friends, {name}. Nobody sings about them. I will."] = "Todo héroe de las canciones tenía amigos, {name}. Nadie les canta. Yo sí."
L["Shields up, {name}. Stormwind taught me to march; nobody taught me to stop."] = "Escudos arriba, {name}. Ventormenta me enseñó a marchar; a parar, nadie."
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Returned the same day, which for a kaldorei is rushing."] = "Ishnu-alah, {name}. Te lo devuelvo hoy mismo, que para un kaldorei es correr."
L["Thank you, {name}. Elune smiles on the generous."] = "Gracias, {name}. Elune sonríe a los generosos."
L["Thank you, {name}. Even the wisps glow brighter, and they're hard to impress."] = "Gracias, {name}. Hasta los fuegos fatuos brillan más, y mira que cuesta."
L["Elune saw that, {name}. She sees everything, so I had best return it."] = "Elune lo vio, {name}. Lo ve todo, así que mejor te lo devuelvo."
L["Thank you, {name}. Returned before I nap for a century or two."] = "Gracias, {name}. Devuelto antes de mi siesta de un siglo o dos."
L["Thank you, {name}. The Ancients will hear of this. They're dreadful gossips."] = "Gracias, {name}. Los Ancestros se enterarán. Son unos chismosos terribles."
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll tell the Sentinels to stop aiming at you."] = "Gracias, {name}. Les diré a las Centinelas que dejen de apuntarte."
L["My people never hurry, {name}. For you, an exception."] = "Mi pueblo nunca se apresura, {name}. Contigo, una excepción."
L["Gladly, {name}. Be still, and let the moonlight find you."] = "Con gusto, {name}. No te muevas y deja que la luna te encuentre."
L["Of course, {name}. Elune's blessings are meant to be shared."] = "Claro, {name}. Las bendiciones de Elune son para compartirlas."
L["At last, {name}! I've waited ten thousand years for someone to ask."] = "¡Por fin, {name}! Llevo diez mil años esperando a que alguien lo pidiera."
L["No riddle, no omen from Elune, {name}. Just a plain yes, for once."] = "Sin acertijos ni presagios de Elune, {name}. Un sí y punto, por una vez."
L["Of course, {name}. Ask in Darnassian next time and I'll add a bow."] = "Claro, {name}. Pídelo en darnassiano y te regalo una reverencia."
L["Elune already said yes, {name}. I'm merely catching up."] = "Elune ya dijo que sí, {name}. Yo solo me pongo al día."
L["Of course, {name}. Stand still and pretend you're a tree. It helps."] = "Claro, {name}. No te muevas y haz como que eres un árbol. Ayuda."
L["Elune-adore, {name}. Walk softly; the trees are light sleepers."] = "Elune-adore, {name}. Pisa suave: los árboles tienen el sueño ligero."
L["May the forest shelter you, {name}, wherever you roam."] = "Que el bosque te dé cobijo, {name}, allá donde vayas."
L["A gift from the shadows, {name}. No, don't look. You won't find me."] = "Un regalo desde las sombras, {name}. No, no mires. No me encontrarás."
L["Elune lights your path, {name}. I'm merely holding the lantern."] = "Elune ilumina tu camino, {name}. Yo solo sostengo el farol."
L["The owls pointed you out, {name}. They have strong opinions. Here."] = "Los búhos te señalaron, {name}. Tienen opiniones muy firmes. Toma."
L["Tyrande would insist, {name}, and nobody argues with Tyrande."] = "Tyrande insistiría, {name}, y nadie le lleva la contraria a Tyrande."
L["Take this, {name}. The last one went to a hippogryph. It was less grateful."] = "Toma, {name}. El último fue para un hipogrifo. Fue menos agradecido."
L["Mind the wildlife, {name}. Half of it is a druid, and all of it is watching."] = "Ojo con la fauna, {name}. La mitad son druidas, y toda te vigila."
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Elune keeps her children close."] = "Ishnu-alah, {name}. Elune protege a sus hijos."
L["Of course I saw you, {name}. It takes a kaldorei to spot a kaldorei."] = "Claro que te vi, {name}. Hace falta un kaldorei para ver a un kaldorei."
L["One kaldorei to another, {name}: we lost a tree, never each other."] = "De kaldorei a kaldorei, {name}: perdimos un árbol, nunca a los nuestros."
L["A kaldorei never leaves kin in the dark, {name}. Unless it's for cover."] = "Un kaldorei nunca deja a los suyos a oscuras, {name}. Salvo para esconderse."
L["Quick one, {name}? By kaldorei reckoning we'll be done before we start."] = "¿Algo rápido, {name}? Para un kaldorei, habremos acabado antes de empezar."
L["I'll be the one you can't see, {name}. That's not a mistake; that's the plan."] = "Seré la sombra que no ves, {name}. No es un error: es el plan."
L["Elune watches the whole party, {name}. I'm just the one who waves at her."] = "Elune vigila a todo el grupo, {name}. Yo solo soy quien la saluda."
L["Ten thousand years of companions, {name}. You lot rank rather high."] = "Diez mil años de compañeros, {name}. Este grupo está en lo más alto."
L["Stay close, {name}. We kaldorei misplaced two World Trees. Not you, though."] = "No te alejes, {name}. Los kaldorei perdimos dos Árboles del Mundo. A ti, no."
L["The moon's up, {name}. For a kaldorei, this is the middle of the morning."] = "Salió la luna, {name}. Para un kaldorei, esto es media mañana."
L["Everyone sensible is asleep, {name}. Elune and I prefer it this way."] = "La gente sensata duerme, {name}. Elune y yo lo preferimos así."
L["Moonlight suits you, {name}. This is merely a second layer."] = "La luna te sienta bien, {name}. Esto es solo una segunda capa."
L["Morning, {name}. My people slept through these for millennia. I'm adapting."] = "Buenos días, {name}. Mi pueblo durmió las mañanas durante milenios. Me adapto."
L["Dawn, {name}. Elune's gone to bed, so I'm covering for her."] = "Amanece, {name}. Elune se fue a dormir, así que la cubro yo."
L["The sun's up, {name}, and so, reluctantly, am I."] = "Salió el sol, {name}, y yo también, a regañadientes."
L["The shadows remember kindness, {name}. So do I."] = "Las sombras recuerdan la bondad, {name}. Y yo también."
L["My thanks, {name}. The ren'dorei do not forget a kindness."] = "Te lo agradezco, {name}. Los ren'dorei no olvidan un favor."
L["Thank you, {name}. The voices approve of you, which is frankly alarming."] = "Gracias, {name}. Las voces te aprueban, y eso, francamente, me alarma."
L["Thank you, {name}. Few give gifts to someone who glows this ominously."] = "Gracias, {name}. Pocos regalan algo a quien brilla de forma tan ominosa."
L["Kindness is rare in the Void, {name}. I'll return yours before it notices."] = "En el Vacío la bondad escasea, {name}. Te la devuelvo antes de que lo note."
L["Silvermoon threw us out, {name}. People like you make it hard to mind."] = "Lunargenta nos echó, {name}. Con gente como tú, cuesta que me importe."
L["Returned in full, {name}. It may be slightly purple. That's normal."] = "Devuelto entero, {name}. Puede que salga algo morado. Es normal."
L["The Void only takes, {name}. I, however, give back."] = "El Vacío solo quita, {name}. Yo, en cambio, devuelvo."
L["As you wish, {name}. The shadows answer kindly today."] = "Como desees, {name}. Hoy las sombras están de buenas."
L["Consider it done, {name}. The Void obeys us, not the other way round."] = "Dalo por hecho, {name}. El Vacío nos obedece a nosotros, no al revés."
L["Certainly, {name}. The whispers said no, so it's an easy yes."] = "Claro, {name}. Los susurros dijeron que no, así que sí."
L["Of course, {name}. One {buff}, lightly seasoned with the Void."] = "Claro, {name}. Marchando {buff}, con una pizca de Vacío."
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still; the shadows are shy with strangers."] = "Claro, {name}. No te muevas, que las sombras son tímidas con los extraños."
L["Gladly, {name}. Ren'dorei manners: the Void waits its turn."] = "Con gusto, {name}. Modales ren'dorei: el Vacío espera su turno."
L["Asked so nicely, {name}? The Void never says please. Here."] = "¿Con esa educación, {name}? El Vacío nunca pide por favor. Toma."
L["A touch of shadow for you, {name}. Quite safe. Mostly."] = "Un toque de sombra para ti, {name}. Es seguro. Casi siempre."
L["Walk carefully in the dark places, {name}."] = "Camina con cuidado en la oscuridad, {name}."
L["A little something from the Telogrus Rift, {name}. It's cleaner than it sounds."] = "Un detalle de Telogrus, {name}. Está más limpio de lo que suena."
L["Take this, {name}. Any tentacles you see are purely decorative."] = "Toma, {name}. Si ves algún tentáculo, es puramente decorativo."
L["The shadows asked after you, {name}. I told them to mind their manners."] = "Las sombras preguntaron por ti, {name}. Les dije que tuvieran modales."
L["Here, {name}. We walked into the Void so you wouldn't have to."] = "Toma, {name}. Entramos en el Vacío para que tú no tuvieras que hacerlo."
L["I checked your shadow, {name}. Nothing lurking. Take this anyway."] = "Revisé tu sombra, {name}. Nada acechando. Toma esto de todos modos."
L["Umbric sends his regards, {name}. He doesn't, but he would."] = "Umbric te manda saludos, {name}. No es verdad, pero lo haría."
L["We ren'dorei look after our own, {name}."] = "Los ren'dorei cuidamos de los nuestros, {name}."
L["Silvermoon's loss, {name}. We're doing splendidly without it."] = "Lunargenta se lo pierde, {name}. Sin ella nos va de maravilla."
L["Your whispers and mine should really meet sometime, {name}."] = "Tus susurros y los míos deberían conocerse algún día, {name}."
L["Two ren'dorei in one place, {name}. Quick, look brooding. It's expected."] = "Dos ren'dorei juntos, {name}. Rápido, cara sombría. Es lo esperado."
L["Stay close, {name}. The whispers are much quieter in company."] = "No te alejes, {name}. Los susurros callan mucho más en compañía."
L["If the shadows start giving orders, {name}, ignore them. I usually do."] = "Si las sombras empiezan a dar órdenes, {name}, ignóralas. Yo suelo hacerlo."
L["Keep an eye on my shadow, {name}. It wanders off when there's a fight."] = "Vigila mi sombra, {name}. Se escapa cuando hay pelea."
L["If I start glowing purple, {name}, carry on. It only means I'm keen."] = "Si me pongo a brillar en morado, {name}, tú sigue. Es que tengo ganas."
L["We ren'dorei make fine companions, {name}. We bring our own dark to hide in."] = "Los ren'dorei somos buena compañía, {name}. Traemos la oscuridad de casa."
L["Night suits the ren'dorei, {name}. We match the decor."] = "La noche nos sienta bien, {name}. Vamos a juego con el decorado."
L["The shadows are longest now, {name}, and in a very generous mood."] = "Ahora las sombras son más largas, {name}, y están muy generosas."
L["Late, {name}? The whispers love a late hour. Lately, so do I."] = "¿Tarde, {name}? Los susurros son de trasnochar. Últimamente, yo también."
L["Thanks, {name}! Kindness received, catalogued and returned!"] = "¡Gracias, {name}! Favor recibido, catalogado y devuelto."
L["Reciprocity engaged! Much obliged, {name}."] = "¡Reciprocidad activada! Mil gracias, {name}."
L["By my calculations, {name}, you're owed exactly one {buff}."] = "Según mis cálculos, {name}, te debo exactamente una dosis de {buff}."
L["Thanks, {name}! I'd build you a thank-you machine, but it'd explode."] = "¡Gracias, {name}! Te haría una máquina agradecedora, pero explotaría."
L["Thank you, {name}! This calls for a celebration. Stand back, I'll build one."] = "¡Gracias, {name}! Esto merece una celebración. Atrás, que te fabrico una."
L["You're too kind, {name}! Returning the favour took only four schematics."] = "¡Qué amable, {name}! Devolverte el favor solo me costó cuatro esquemas."
L["Drat, {name}! I was going to invent gratitude, but you beat me to it."] = "¡Rayos, {name}! Iba a inventar la gratitud, pero te me adelantaste."
L["Oh, {name}, how kind! My heart's doing that whirring thing again."] = "¡Ay, {name}, qué detalle! Mi corazón hace otra vez ese zumbidito."
L["Request received, {name}! Processing... done!"] = "¡Solicitud recibida, {name}! Procesando... ¡hecho!"
L["One upgrade, coming right up, {name}! Stand still for calibration."] = "¡Una mejora marchando, {name}! No te muevas, que calibro."
L["Of course, {name}! I built a machine for this. It's in pieces, so: by hand."] = "¡Claro, {name}! Tengo una máquina para esto. Está en piezas, así que a mano."
L["Certainly, {name}! Stand on the X. There's no X. Stand anywhere."] = "¡Por supuesto, {name}! Ponte sobre la X. No hay X. Ponte donde sea."
L["Right away, {name}! Goggles on. Not for you, I just like them."] = "¡Enseguida, {name}! Gafas puestas. No es por ti, es que me gustan."
L["{buff}, {name}? Simple in theory AND practice. Suspicious!"] = "¿{buff}, {name}? Fácil en teoría Y en la práctica. ¡Mala señal!"
L["Happy to, {name}! Keep hands, feet and eyebrows well clear."] = "¡Con mucho gusto, {name}! Aparta bien manos, pies y cejas."
L["Hold still, {name}, this is perfectly safe. Probably!"] = "No te muevas, {name}, es totalmente seguro. ¡Seguramente!"
L["Science says you need this, {name}. Who am I to argue?"] = "La ciencia lo exige, {name}. ¿Quién soy yo para discutir?"
L["A small upgrade for you, {name}. No cogs required."] = "Una pequeña mejora para ti, {name}. Sin engranajes."
L["Take it, {name}, I've a spare. I've three spares of everything."] = "Tómalo, {name}, tengo repuesto. Tengo tres repuestos de todo."
L["Try this, {name}! Version one had legs. Version two is much better."] = "¡Prueba esto, {name}! La versión uno tenía patas. La dos es mucho mejor."
L["The High Tinker says share our genius, {name}. Here's a sample!"] = "El Manitas Mayor manda compartir nuestro genio, {name}. ¡Muestra gratis!"
L["Gnomeregan Forever, {name}! This lasts rather less, but it's free."] = "¡Gnomeregan para siempre, {name}! Esto dura bastante menos, pero es gratis."
L["I'm small, {name}, but my gifts come full-sized. Here!"] = "Mido poco, {name}, pero regalo a lo grande. ¡Toma!"
L["Don't worry, {name}! It worked on the chicken, and the chicken's thrilled."] = "¡No te preocupes, {name}! Funcionó con la gallina, y está encantada."
L["For Gnomeregan, {name}! Always nice to talk to somebody at eye level."] = "¡Por Gnomeregan, {name}! Da gusto hablar con alguien de mi altura."
L["A fellow gnome, {name}! I'll hold the schematic; you hold the bucket."] = "¡Entre gnomos, {name}! Yo sujeto el plano; tú, el extintor."
L["Flesh or cogs, {name}, we're all gnomes. Some of us just need oiling."] = "Carne o engranajes, {name}, somos gnomos. Unos solo piden más aceite."
L["One gnome to another, {name}: you did turn the reactor off, didn't you?"] = "De gnomo a gnomo, {name}: apagaste el reactor, ¿verdad?"
L["Party-wide calibration complete, {name}! Nobody touch anything shiny."] = "¡Calibración del grupo completada, {name}! Que nadie toque nada brillante."
L["I've run the numbers, {name}: with you here, we win. I rounded up."] = "Hice los cálculos, {name}: contigo aquí, ganamos. Redondeé hacia arriba."
L["If I shout 'duck', {name}, don't look for a duck. That went badly last time."] = "Si grito '¡ojo!', {name}, no te toques el ojo. La última vez salió fatal."
L["Formation, {name}: tall folk at the front, me somewhere safe and clever."] = "Formación, {name}: los altos delante; yo, en la retaguardia estratégica."
L["Everyone gets one, {name}! Standardised parts are the secret of a good machine."] = "¡Uno por cabeza, {name}! Las piezas estándar son el secreto de una buena máquina."
L["Morning, {name}! Up since three. The toaster needed a new engine."] = "¡Buenos días, {name}! En pie desde las tres: la tostadora pedía motor nuevo."
L["Good morning, {name}! The coffee's brewing itself. It learned how. Worrying."] = "¡Buenos días, {name}! El café se prepara solo. Aprendió. Preocupante."
L["Early start, {name}! Best ideas come before breakfast. So do the explosions."] = "¡Temprano, {name}! Lo mejor llega antes del desayuno: ideas y explosiones."
L["The Light rewards kindness, {name}. I'm simply its fastest courier."] = "La Luz premia la bondad, {name}. Yo solo hago el reparto exprés."
L["Archenon poros, {name}. Your gift is returned."] = "Archenon poros, {name}. Te devuelvo tu regalo."
L["Thanks, {name}. I'd offer a lift in the Exodar, but you've seen how it lands."] = "Gracias, {name}. Te llevaría en el Exodar, pero ya viste cómo aterriza."
L["A gift freely given, {name}. The naaru hum a little louder. Returned."] = "Regalo sincero, {name}: los naaru zumban más fuerte. Te lo devuelvo."
L["Kindly done, {name}. On Argus we'd have carved that in crystal. Here."] = "Muy amable, {name}. En Argus lo habríamos tallado en cristal. Toma."
L["Across a dozen worlds, {name}, kindness is the one tongue I never had to learn."] = "En doce mundos, {name}, la bondad fue el único idioma que no tuve que aprender."
L["What a kindness, {name}. It almost makes up for the Legion. Almost."] = "Qué detalle, {name}. Casi compensa lo de la Legión. Casi."
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd say it in Draenei, but that takes eleven minutes."] = "Gracias, {name}. Te lo diría en draenei, pero se tarda once minutos."
L["Of course, {name}. The naaru guide your steps; this puts a spring in them."] = "Claro, {name}. Los naaru guían tus pasos; esto les da más brío."
L["Gladly, {name}. The Light answers those who ask."] = "Con gusto, {name}. La Luz responde a quien la llama."
L["Velen foresaw you asking, {name}. I foresaw saying yes."] = "Velen previó que lo pedirías, {name}. Yo preví que diría que sí."
L["The Light is not rationed, {name}. Take as much as you like."] = "La Luz no está racionada, {name}. Toma toda la que quieras."
L["Of course, {name}. I've outrun the Burning Legion; I can manage this."] = "Claro, {name}. Dejé atrás a la Legión Ardiente; esto no es nada."
L["At once, {name}. Hooves planted, crystals humming, here it comes."] = "Al instante, {name}. Pezuñas firmes, cristales zumbando, ¡ahí va!"
L["Gladly, {name}. I followed a talking crystal across the stars. This is easy."] = "Con gusto, {name}. Seguí a un cristal parlante por las estrellas. Esto es fácil."
L["The Light is with you, {name}. Go in peace, or at least go prepared."] = "La Luz está contigo, {name}. Ve en paz. O, por lo menos, con esto."
L["Walk in the Light, {name}. May it shelter you always."] = "Camina en la Luz, {name}. Que siempre te proteja."
L["Take this, {name}. My people always travel Light."] = "Toma, {name}. Mi pueblo viaja con poco equipaje y mucha Luz."
L["Take this, {name}. The Legion is always coming. I'd know."] = "Toma, {name}. La Legión siempre está al llegar. Lo sé bien."
L["I'm out of miracles today, {name}. Will {buff} do?"] = "Hoy se me acabaron los milagros, {name}. ¿Te sirve {buff}?"
L["For the road, {name}. Mine has been twenty-five thousand years long."] = "Para el camino, {name}. El mío ya dura veinticinco mil años."
L["Blessed by a naaru, {name}. Well, I stood near one. It still counts."] = "Bendición de naaru, {name}. Bueno, estuve cerca de uno. Cuenta igual."
L["Take this, {name}. It glows a bit. Everything we own does."] = "Toma, {name}. Brilla un poco. Todo lo nuestro brilla."
L["Archenon poros, {name}! The children of Argus look after one another."] = "¡Archenon poros, {name}! Los hijos de Argus se cuidan entre sí."
L["Home is wherever two draenei meet, {name}. Today, it's here."] = "El hogar está donde se encuentran dos draenei, {name}. Hoy, aquí."
L["Horns high, {name}. Two draenei, and nobody's mentioned the Legion. Progress."] = "Cuernos en alto, {name}. Dos draenei y nadie mencionó a la Legión. Progresamos."
L["Tails up, {name}. Argus would be proud of what we've made of exile."] = "Cola en alto, {name}. Argus se enorgullecería de nuestro exilio."
L["Stay near, {name}. I lost a world once; I'm keeping hold of this party."] = "No te alejes, {name}. Ya perdí un mundo; este grupo no lo suelto."
L["Twenty-five thousand years on the run, {name}. Walking with friends is nicer."] = "Veinticinco mil años huyendo, {name}. Con amigos se camina mejor."
L["The naaru would call this a fellowship, {name}. I call it good luck."] = "Los naaru lo llamarían comunión, {name}. Yo lo llamo buena suerte."
L["I've watched worlds end, {name}. Whatever's ahead of us hardly worries me."] = "Vi acabarse mundos, {name}. Lo que nos espera apenas me preocupa."
L["Stay together, {name}. The Light finds us easier when we're all in one place."] = "No nos separemos, {name}. A la Luz le cuesta menos encontrarnos si estamos juntos."
L["Much obliged, {name}. Gilneas never forgets a kindness, and nor does my nose."] = "Mil gracias, {name}. Gilneas nunca olvida un favor, y mi hocico tampoco."
L["Thank you, {name}. You have my gratitude, and my best howl."] = "Gracias, {name}. Tienes mi gratitud, y mi mejor aullido."
L["Thank you, {name}. If worgen had tails, mine would be wagging."] = "Gracias, {name}. Si los huargen tuviéramos cola, estaría meneándola."
L["You've made a friend for life, {name}. Loyalty is rather our thing."] = "Tienes mi amistad de por vida, {name}. La lealtad es lo nuestro."
L["The beast in me wants to growl, {name}. The Gilnean in me insists on thanks."] = "Mi bestia quiere gruñir, {name}. Mi lado gilneano insiste en dar las gracias."
L["Much appreciated, {name}. I'd shake your hand, but, claws. Here instead."] = "Te lo agradezco, {name}. Te daría la mano, pero... garras. Mejor esto."
L["We walled ourselves off for years, {name}. You make that look silly."] = "Pasamos años tras una muralla, {name}. Tú haces que parezca una tontería."
L["Obliged, {name}. You've earned a spot by the fire. The good spot."] = "Gracias, {name}. Te ganaste un sitio junto al fuego. El bueno."
L["Certainly, {name}. Hold still, I don't bite. Much."] = "Desde luego, {name}. No te muevas, que no muerdo. Mucho."
L["Right you are, {name}. Stand steady now."] = "Entendido, {name}. Aguanta firme."
L["Right away, {name}. Stay, now. I've always wanted to say that."] = "Enseguida, {name}. ¡Sin moverse! Por una vez, lo digo yo."
L["Gladly, {name}. Rain or shine, and in Gilneas it's rain."] = "Con gusto, {name}. Llueva o haga sol, y en Gilneas, llueve."
L["Certainly, {name}. I'll try not to shed on you."] = "Claro, {name}. Intentaré no llenarte de pelos."
L["Say no more, {name}. These ears heard you before you'd decided to ask."] = "No digas más, {name}. Estas orejas te oyeron antes de que lo pensaras."
L["Of course, {name}. You asked nicer than the last fellow who threw me a stick."] = "Claro, {name}. Lo pediste mejor que el último que me tiró un palo."
L["Stay off the moors after dark, {name}. Take this."] = "No salgas a los páramos de noche, {name}. Toma esto."
L["Keep your wits about you, {name}. Something is always hunting."] = "Mantén los ojos abiertos, {name}. Siempre hay algo cazando."
L["I'd have brought this sooner, {name}, but I stopped to chase something."] = "Te lo habría traído antes, {name}, pero me paré a perseguir algo."
L["For you, {name}. No, I don't want a treat. Well. Perhaps a small one."] = "Para ti, {name}. No, no quiero premio. Bueno. Quizá uno pequeñito."
L["Gilneans always offer, {name}. The claws are just part of the outfit."] = "Los gilneanos siempre ofrecen, {name}. Las garras son parte del atuendo."
L["An old Gilnean remedy, {name}. Good for colds, gloom and most curses. Not mine."] = "Remedio gilneano, {name}. Cura resfriados, penas y maldiciones. La mía, no."
L["Run with this, {name}. Trust me, I know about running."] = "Corre con esto, {name}. Hazme caso, de correr sé mucho."
L["Fetched this for you, {name}. Don't make a thing of it."] = "Te traje esto, {name}. Y sin hacer fiestas, ¿eh?"
L["The curse binds us, {name}, but Gilneas binds us tighter."] = "La maldición nos une, {name}, pero Gilneas nos une más."
L["No need to explain the ears to you, {name}."] = "A ti no tengo que explicarte las orejas, {name}."
L["Fur, fog and rain, {name}. Only a Gilnean understands all three."] = "Pelaje, niebla y lluvia, {name}. Solo en Gilneas se entienden las tres."
L["Pack looks after pack, {name}. Always has."] = "La manada cuida de los suyos, {name}. Siempre."
L["Pack rules, {name}: nobody wanders off, and nobody mentions the fleas."] = "Normas de la manada, {name}: nadie se aleja y nadie menciona las pulgas."
L["A pack again, {name}. I hadn't known how much I'd missed one."] = "Otra vez en manada, {name}. No sabía cuánto lo echaba de menos."
L["I'll catch the scent of trouble first, {name}. It's the one perk of the curse."] = "Oleré los problemas antes que nadie, {name}. La única ventaja de la maldición."
L["If I howl, {name}, it's a battle cry. Probably. Don't look at me like that."] = "Si aúllo, {name}, es un grito de guerra. Seguramente. No me mires así."
L["Lead on, {name}. I'll trot. It's undignified, but it's much quicker."] = "Adelante, {name}. Yo voy al trote: poco digno, pero rapidísimo."
L["Night again, {name}. I'm at my best and my worst. This is the best part."] = "De noche otra vez, {name}. Saco lo mejor y lo peor de mí. Esto es lo mejor."
L["Look at that moon, {name}. Don't mind me; I'm not howling. Much."] = "Mira qué luna, {name}. Tú ni caso; no estoy aullando. Mucho."
L["Gilneas at night was fog and footsteps, {name}. These days I'm the footsteps."] = "Gilneas de noche era niebla y pasos, {name}. Hoy los pasos soy yo."
L["Morning, {name}. I'd have been up sooner, but the rug by the fire was so warm."] = "Buenos días, {name}. Habría madrugado, pero la alfombra del hogar calentaba tanto..."
L["Smells like rain this morning, {name}. Everything in Gilneas smelled like rain."] = "Huele a lluvia esta mañana, {name}. En Gilneas todo olía a lluvia."
L["Up already, {name}? I've chased two rabbits. For exercise. Purely."] = "¿Ya en pie, {name}? Perseguí dos conejos. Por hacer ejercicio. Sin más."
L["Throm-ka, {name}! Honour is repaid."] = "¡Throm-ka, {name}! El honor queda saldado."
L["You give freely, {name}. I return the favour."] = "Das sin pedir nada, {name}. Te devuelvo el favor."
L["Orcs keep their thanks short, {name}. Thanks."] = "Los orcos somos de pocas palabras, {name}. Gracias."
L["Orcs return every blow twice, {name}. The kind ones too."] = "Un orco lo devuelve todo por duplicado, {name}. Golpes y favores."
L["You helped me, I help you. Orc poetry, {name}. It doesn't rhyme."] = "Tú me ayudaste, yo te ayudo. Poesía orca, {name}. No rima."
L["In the old days I'd have repaid you with a boar, {name}. This keeps better."] = "Antes te lo habría pagado con un jabalí, {name}. Esto se conserva mejor."
L["Owing somebody itches worse than Durotar sand, {name}. There. Itch gone."] = "Deber algo pica más que la arena de Durotar, {name}. Listo. Ya no pica."
L["Strong stuff, {name}. I could wrestle a kodo now. So can you."] = "Esto es fuerte, {name}. Ahora podría tumbar a un kodo. Y tú también."
L["Dabu, {name}. It is done."] = "Dabu, {name}. Hecho."
L["Hold still, {name}. Strength for the fight ahead."] = "No te muevas, {name}. Fuerza para la batalla que viene."
L["Ask an orc for help and you get it, {name}. Ask for subtlety and you wait."] = "Pide ayuda a un orco y la tendrás, {name}. Pide sutileza y ya puedes esperar."
L["Help, yes. Hugging, no. Hold still, {name}."] = "Ayuda, sí. Abrazos, no. No te muevas, {name}."
L["You want {buff}? You have {buff}, {name}. Next."] = "¿Quieres {buff}? Tienes {buff}, {name}. Siguiente."
L["Don't flinch, {name}. My helping face looks exactly like my fighting face."] = "No te encojas, {name}. Mi cara de ayudar es igual que mi cara de pelear."
L["Short question, short answer, {name}: yes."] = "Pregunta corta, respuesta corta, {name}: sí."
L["Lok'tar ogar, {name}! Take this into battle. A tavern brawl also counts."] = "¡Lok'tar ogar, {name}! Para la batalla. Una pelea de taberna también cuenta."
L["Blood and thunder, {name}! Go and earn your glory."] = "¡Sangre y trueno, {name}! Ve a ganarte la gloria."
L["Among orcs, {name}, making you stronger is how we say we like you."] = "Entre orcos, {name}, hacerte más fuerte es decir 'me caes bien'."
L["An orc giving gifts unasked? Tell no one, {name}. It ruins the image."] = "¿Un orco regalando cosas? Ni una palabra, {name}. Arruina la imagen."
L["I was told to be more diplomatic, {name}. This is me being diplomatic."] = "Me pidieron más diplomacia, {name}. Esto es diplomacia."
L["Go hit something for me, {name}. Or set it on fire. Orcs aren't fussy."] = "Pégale a algo por mí, {name}. O quémalo. A los orcos nos da igual."
L["Don't thank me, {name}. Just win, and do it loudly."] = "No me des las gracias, {name}. Gana, y que se oiga."
L["I'd make a speech, {name}, but it's mostly shouting. Just take it."] = "Daría un discurso, {name}, pero son casi todo gritos. Tómalo y ya."
L["Throm-ka, {name}! The blood of the clans runs strong in you."] = "¡Throm-ka, {name}! La sangre de los clanes corre fuerte en ti."
L["An orc, {name}! Finally, somebody who shouts at my volume."] = "¡Sangre orca, {name}! Por fin alguien que grita a mi volumen."
L["Frostwolf, Warsong or Blackrock, {name}, we all argue like family."] = "Lobo Gélido, Grito de Guerra o Roca Negra, {name}: reñimos como familia."
L["Between orcs no words are needed, {name}. Good. I was out of them."] = "Entre orcos sobran las palabras, {name}. Mejor. Se me acabaron."
L["The plan, {name}: we hit it. Questions? No? Good plan."] = "El plan, {name}: le pegamos. ¿Preguntas? ¿No? Buen plan."
L["A true warband, {name}. Loud, angry, and all on the same side for once."] = "Partida de guerra de verdad, {name}: gritos, rabia y, por fin, un solo bando."
L["Stay with the warband, {name}. Strength in numbers. And in axes."] = "No te separes de la partida, {name}. La unión hace la fuerza. Y las hachas."
L["If you fall, {name}, I carry you out. Complaining the whole way, but I carry."] = "Si caes, {name}, te saco a cuestas. Quejándome todo el camino, pero te saco."
L["Fight well, {name}, and tonight you share our fire. And our boasting."] = "Pelea bien, {name}, y esta noche hay hoguera para ti. Y fanfarronadas."
L["Thank you, {name}. It would warm my heart, if it still beat."] = "Gracias, {name}. Me alegraría el corazón, si aún latiera."
L["Such warmth, for one so cold? Returned in full, {name}."] = "¿Tanto calor para un cuerpo frío? Te lo devuelvo, {name}."
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd blush, but the blood stopped reaching my face."] = "Gracias, {name}. Me sonrojaría, pero la sangre ya no me llega a la cara."
L["My undying gratitude, {name}. For once, the phrase is accurate."] = "Mi gratitud eterna, {name}. En mi caso, va al pie de la letra."
L["Most kind, {name}. You've lifted me from 'deceased' to 'mildly deceased'."] = "Muy amable, {name}. Pasé de 'cadáver' a 'cadáver algo animado'."
L["You've added years to my life, {name}. Shame it already ended."] = "Me diste años de vida, {name}. Lástima que ya se me acabara."
L["I felt that, {name}, and I don't feel much these days. Here, feel this."] = "Eso lo sentí, {name}, y ya siento muy poco. Toma, siente esto."
L["I'd shake your hand, {name}, but I'm not sure mine is still attached."] = "Te daría la mano, {name}, pero no sé si la mía sigue pegada."
L["Certainly, {name}. Try not to die. It's overrated."] = "Desde luego, {name}. Intenta no morir. Está sobrevalorado."
L["You need only ask, {name}. The dead are patient."] = "Basta con pedirlo, {name}. Los muertos somos pacientes."
L["Ask the dead for a favour, {name}. We rarely have other plans."] = "Pídele un favor a un muerto, {name}. Rara vez tenemos otros planes."
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand clear; I'd hate to drop anything on you."] = "Claro, {name}. Apártate un poco, que a veces se me cae algo."
L["A moment, {name}. Rigor mortis is hard on the casting hand."] = "Un momento, {name}. El rigor mortis no perdona la mano de lanzar."
L["Nice to be asked for something, {name}, besides the way to the graveyard."] = "Da gusto que me pidan algo, {name}, aparte del camino al cementerio."
L["Gladly, {name}. It takes my mind off the smell. Mine, I mean."] = "Con gusto, {name}. Así me distraigo del olor. Del mío, digo."
L["Stay among the living a little longer, {name}."] = "Quédate entre los vivos un poco más, {name}."
L["Take this, {name}. The grave can wait."] = "Toma, {name}. La tumba puede esperar."
L["I was a physician in Lordaeron, {name}. Old habits die harder than I did."] = "Sanaba en Lordaeron, {name}. Morí yo, pero la costumbre no."
L["No charge, {name}. The apothecaries would have made you sign something."] = "Gratis, {name}. Los boticarios te habrían hecho firmar algo."
L["A gift from the grave, {name}. Don't worry, I washed it."] = "Un regalo de ultratumba, {name}. No te preocupes, lo lavé."
L["Every body needs a little help, {name}. Mine mostly needs stitches."] = "Todo cuerpo necesita ayuda, {name}. El mío, sobre todo hilo y aguja."
L["I've seen where heroes end up, {name}. I live there. Take this."] = "Sé dónde acaban los héroes, {name}. Vivo allí. Toma esto."
L["Take this, {name}. I learned the hard way you can't take it with you."] = "Toma, {name}. Aprendí por las malas que al otro lado no te llevas nada."
L["We Forsaken must look after each other, {name}."] = "Los Renegados tenemos que cuidarnos, {name}."
L["Between us corpses, {name}, you're remarkably well preserved."] = "Entre cadáveres, {name}, te conservas de maravilla."
L["Lose a finger, {name}, and I've a spare. Forsaken share."] = "¿Pierdes un dedo, {name}? Te presto uno. Hoy por ti, mañana por mí."
L["Is your jaw clicking too, {name}, or is that just me?"] = "¿A ti también te cruje la mandíbula, {name}, o solo a mí?"
L["Stay alive, {name}. I've tried the alternative, and I can't recommend it."] = "Sigue con vida, {name}. Probé la alternativa y no la recomiendo."
L["If I fall down, {name}, give it a minute. Old habit."] = "Si caigo, {name}, espera un minuto. Es la costumbre."
L["I'll take the front, {name}. What's the worst that could happen? Again?"] = "Voy delante, {name}. ¿Qué es lo peor que puede pasar? ¿Otra vez?"
L["Keep upwind of me, {name}. It's better for morale."] = "Que el viento no te lleve mi olor, {name}. Es por la moral."
L["The last party I joined, {name}, I woke up in a crypt. Let's improve on that."] = "En el último grupo en que estuve, {name}, desperté en una cripta. Mejoremos eso."
L["The dead keep terrible hours, {name}. Nice to have company for once."] = "Los muertos tenemos horarios terribles, {name}. Da gusto tener compañía."
L["Midnight, {name}: the best hour to be up and about when you shouldn't be."] = "Medianoche, {name}: la mejor hora para andar por ahí cuando no se debe."
L["The living are all asleep, {name}. We Forsaken call this the quiet shift."] = "Los vivos duermen, {name}. Los Renegados lo llamamos el turno tranquilo."
L["Morning already, {name}? I've been up all night. And all of last decade."] = "¿Ya es de día, {name}? Llevo toda la noche en pie. Y toda la última década."
L["The sun's up, {name}. I'll stand in the shade, if you don't mind. Things peel."] = "Salió el sol, {name}. Me quedo a la sombra, si no te importa. Se me pela todo."
L["Early start, {name}. The dead never sleep in. Or at all, really."] = "Temprano, {name}. Los muertos no remoloneamos. Ni dormimos, en realidad."
L["The Earth Mother saw your kindness, {name}. She nudged me. Quite hard."] = "La Madre Tierra vio tu bondad, {name}. Me dio un codazo. Bien fuerte."
L["Thank you, {name}. May the winds guide you."] = "Gracias, {name}. Que los vientos te guíen."
L["Thank you, {name}. I'm deeply moved, and it takes a lot to move a tauren."] = "Gracias, {name}. Me conmueves, y mover a un tauren no es fácil."
L["It's a long way up to a tauren's heart, {name}. You found it."] = "El corazón de un tauren queda muy arriba, {name}. Tú llegaste."
L["I felt that from horn to hoof, {name}. Returned, hoof to horn."] = "Lo sentí de cuernos a pezuñas, {name}. Devuelto, de pezuñas a cuernos."
L["A gift given is a seed planted, {name}. Here is the harvest."] = "Regalo dado es semilla plantada, {name}. Aquí está la cosecha."
L["That deserves a feast, {name}. The feast can wait; {buff} can't."] = "Esto merece un festín, {name}. El festín puede esperar; {buff}, no."
L["Thank you, {name}. Should you ever need a wall to hide behind, I'm free."] = "Gracias, {name}. Si te hace falta un muro para esconderte, estoy libre."
L["Of course, {name}. Stand tall and be at peace. I'll handle the tall part."] = "Claro, {name}. Alza la cabeza y ten paz. De la altura me encargo yo."
L["Ask and it is given, {name}. The herd shares what it has."] = "Pide y se te dará, {name}. La manada comparte lo que tiene."
L["Of course, {name}. Stand back a pace; I do this with my whole body."] = "Claro, {name}. Échate un paso atrás; esto lo hago con todo el cuerpo."
L["Gladly, {name}. Mind the tail."] = "Con gusto, {name}. Cuidado con la cola."
L["The Earth Mother gives freely, {name}, and so do her largest children."] = "La Madre Tierra da sin pedir nada, {name}, y sus hijos más grandes también."
L["Gladly, {name}. Tauren are slow to anger and quick to help. Quick-ish."] = "Con gusto, {name}. Los tauren: lentos para la ira, rápidos para ayudar. Casi."
L["Refuse you, {name}? My ancestors would never let me hear the end of it."] = "¿Negarme, {name}? Mis ancestros no me dejarían en paz jamás."
L["Walk with the Earth Mother, {name}. She's everywhere, so you can't get lost."] = "Camina con la Madre Tierra, {name}. Está en todas partes: no puedes perderte."
L["May An'she light your path, {name}."] = "Que An'she ilumine tu camino, {name}."
L["You looked like you could use a friend, {name}. I'm a very big one."] = "Parecías necesitar un apoyo, {name}. Yo soy uno enorme."
L["Take this, {name}. The Earth Mother would scold me if I walked past."] = "Toma, {name}. La Madre Tierra me regañaría si pasara de largo."
L["Tread lightly, {name}. Take it from someone who never has."] = "Pisa con suavidad, {name}. Te lo dice alguien que nunca lo hizo."
L["The wind said you'd pass this way, {name}. The wind is a terrible gossip."] = "El viento me dijo que pasarías por aquí, {name}. Es un chismoso terrible."
L["Take this, {name}. I'd lend you my kodo too, but he's less generous than me."] = "Toma, {name}. Te prestaría mi kodo, pero es menos generoso que yo."
L["The shu'halo say carry what you can for others, {name}. I can carry a lot."] = "Los shu'halo dicen: carga lo que puedas por los demás, {name}. Yo puedo mucho."
L["The Earth Mother watches over us both, {name}."] = "La Madre Tierra vela por los dos, {name}."
L["Somebody warn the doorframes, {name}. There are two of us now."] = "Que alguien avise a las puertas, {name}. Ahora somos dos."
L["Plains or peaks, {name}, a shu'halo heart is a big one."] = "Llanura o montaña, {name}, un corazón shu'halo es grande."
L["Horns and helmets, {name}. Only another tauren knows the pain."] = "Cuernos y yelmos, {name}. Solo otro tauren entiende ese dolor."
L["Get behind me, {name}. There's room back there for the whole party."] = "Ponte detrás de mí, {name}. Ahí cabe todo el grupo."
L["The herd moves together, {name}. Mind my hooves; the herd has learned to."] = "La manada va unida, {name}. Ojo con mis pezuñas: la manada ya aprendió."
L["Low ceilings ahead, {name}? I'll be the first to find out. Take this."] = "¿Techos bajos más adelante, {name}? Lo sabré antes que nadie. Toma."
L["I'm slow to anger, {name}, but I hold a grudge for the whole party."] = "Me cuesta perder la calma, {name}, pero guardo rencor por todo el grupo."
L["Need a wall to hide behind, {name}? I'm most of one. Come on."] = "¿Te hace falta un muro, {name}? Soy casi uno. Vamos."
L["An'she rises, {name}, and so do we. Slower, in my case."] = "An'she se alza, {name}, y nosotros también. Yo, más despacio."
L["The sun is An'she's eye, {name}. He's watching, so let's look busy."] = "El sol es el ojo de An'she, {name}. Nos mira: hagamos como que trabajamos."
L["Morning, {name}. The kodo are up, the grass is wet, and this is yours."] = "Buenos días, {name}. Los kodos en pie, la hierba mojada, y esto es para ti."
L["Mu'sha keeps the night watch, {name}. I'll tell her to keep an eye on you."] = "Mu'sha hace la guardia nocturna, {name}. Le diré que no te pierda de vista."
L["The moon's out, {name}. Mu'sha sees you, and she approves. I asked."] = "Salió la luna, {name}. Mu'sha te ve y le parece bien. Se lo pregunté."
L["Late, {name}. The kodo are asleep, and they snore like thunder. Take this."] = "Es tarde, {name}. Los kodos duermen y roncan como truenos. Toma."
L["Ya be too kind, {name}! Dis one be from me."] = "¡Ere' mu' amable, {name}! Esta va de mi parte."
L["Thanks, mon! Da spirits smile on ya, {name}."] = "¡Gracias, mon! Los espíritus te sonríen, {name}."
L["Ya gave me good mojo, {name}. Now ya get some back, extra spicy."] = "Me diste buen mojo, {name}. Ahora te lo devuelvo, extra picante, mon."
L["Bwonsamdi gonna be real disappointed, {name}. Thanks, mon."] = "Bwonsamdi se va a llevar un buen chasco, {name}. Gracia', mon."
L["Dat be some fine work, {name}. Almost as fine as me. Almost."] = "Eso e' trabajo fino, {name}. Casi tan fino como yo. Casi."
L["A troll can grow back a hand, {name}. Can't grow back honour. Here."] = "A un trol le vuelve a crecer una mano, {name}. El honor no. Toma."
L["Ya just made a troll smile, {name}, and we got a lot of teeth."] = "Hiciste sonreír a un trol, {name}, y tenemo' muchos dientes."
L["Da loa keep a tally, {name}, and now ya on da good side of it."] = "Lo' loa llevan la cuenta, {name}, y ahora está' en el lado bueno."
L["Sure ting, {name}. Hold still; da mojo don't like a movin' target."] = "Claro, {name}. No te mueva': el mojo odia los blancos móviles."
L["No worries, {name}. Da loa got ya covered."] = "Tranqui, {name}. Los loa te protegen."
L["Stay away from da voodoo, {name}. ...Except dis voodoo. Dis one fine."] = "Aléjate del vudú, {name}. ...Menos de este vudú. Este tá bien."
L["Close ya eyes, {name}. Da mojo be shy when people watch."] = "Cierra lo' ojo', {name}. El mojo e' tímido si lo miran."
L["Ya don't gotta ask twice, {name}. Ya barely gotta ask once."] = "No tiene' que pedirlo do' vece', {name}. Casi ni una."
L["Sure, {name}. Bein' a troll be mostly swagger. Da rest be dis."] = "Claro, {name}. Ser trol e' casi todo actitud. Lo demá' e' esto."
L["Ya asked real polite, {name}. Polite get da good stuff."] = "Lo pediste con modale', {name}. Los modale' se llevan lo bueno."
L["Da loa be watchin' over ya, {name}. Dey real nosy like dat."] = "Lo' loa velan por ti, {name}. Son mu' fisgones, mon."
L["Stay sharp out dere, {name}. Take dis wit' ya."] = "Ojo avizor ahí afuera, {name}. Llévate esto, mon."
L["Ya look like somebody who appreciate quality, {name}. Here: quality."] = "Parece' alguien que aprecia la calidad, {name}. Toma: calidad."
L["Take dis, {name}. Walk like ya own da jungle. I do."] = "Toma, {name}. Anda como si la selva fuera tuya. Como yo."
L["Everybody need mojo, {name}. I make so much I gotta give it away."] = "To' el mundo necesita mojo, {name}. Yo hago tanto que tengo que regalarlo."
L["A little somethin' for ya, {name}. Don't ask where da loa got it."] = "Un detallito pa' ti, {name}. No pregunte' de dónde lo sacaron lo' loa."
L["Go on, {name}. Anyting try to eat ya now gonna get indigestion."] = "Ve, {name}. Si algo intenta comerte, le va a dar indigestión."
L["Ya lookin' dangerous now, {name}. Almost troll-level dangerous."] = "Ahora sí que impone', {name}. Casi a nivel trol."
L["Hey, {name}! Always good to see family, mon."] = "¡Eh, {name}! Siempre es bueno ver a la familia, mon."
L["Da rest of Azeroth stand up straight, {name}. We got more style."] = "El resto de Azeroth anda derecho, {name}. Nosotro' tenemo' más estilo."
L["Hey, {name}, ya tusks be lookin' sharp. Mine too, obviously."] = "Eh, {name}, qué afilados esos colmillos. Los míos también, claro."
L["Every troll be family, {name}. Even da ones who still owe me gold."] = "To' los trols son familia, {name}. Hasta lo' que aún me deben oro."
L["Stay close, {name}. Trolls regenerate; da rest of ya gotta be careful."] = "No te alejes, {name}. Un trol se regenera; lo' demás, cuidadito."
L["Dis crew got style, {name}. Now it got mojo too."] = "Este grupo tiene estilo, {name}. Y ahora también mojo."
L["We go in together, {name}, we come out together. Dat be da whole plan, mon."] = "Entramo' juntos, {name}, salimo' juntos. Ese e' to' el plan, mon."
L["Nobody fallin' today, {name}. Bwonsamdi can wait for da next group."] = "Hoy no cae nadie, {name}. Bwonsamdi que espere al próximo grupo."
L["Keep ya head down, {name}. I keep mine up. Somebody gotta look good."] = "Agacha la cabeza, {name}. Yo la llevo alta. Alguien tiene que lucirse."
L["Night be da best time for mojo, {name}. Nobody see where it come from."] = "La noche e' la mejor hora pa'l mojo, {name}. Nadie ve de dónde sale."
L["Da jungle wake up at night, {name}. So do I. Here, dis one fresh."] = "La selva despierta de noche, {name}. Yo también. Toma, recién hecho."
L["Moon be high, {name}, spirits be restless. Dis keep dem off ya."] = "Luna alta, {name}, espíritus inquietos. Esto te los quita de encima."
L["Such courtesy does you credit, {name}. Nearly as much as it does me."] = "Tanta cortesía te honra, {name}. Casi tanto como a mí."
L["How gracious, {name}. Allow me to return the favour."] = "Qué gentileza, {name}. Permíteme devolverte el favor."
L["Thank you, {name}. I haven't felt this radiant since... well, this morning."] = "Gracias, {name}. No me sentía tan radiante desde... bueno, esta mañana."
L["Kind of you, {name}. We sin'dorei never turn down free magic. Ask anyone."] = "Qué amable, {name}. Los sin'dorei jamás rechazamos magia gratis. Es sabido."
L["Exquisite, {name}. I would know; I only accept the exquisite."] = "Exquisito, {name}. Sé de lo que hablo: solo acepto lo exquisito."
L["Lovely, {name}. I'll be insufferable about this all day. More than usual."] = "Precioso, {name}. Hoy voy a estar insufrible con esto. Más de lo normal."
L["Thank you, {name}. It even goes with my gold trim. You have an eye."] = "Gracias, {name}. Hasta combina con mis ribetes dorados. Tienes buen ojo."
L["Returned in kind, {name}. A prettier kind, admittedly. I can't help it."] = "Te lo devuelvo igual, {name}. Bueno, más bonito. No lo puedo evitar."
L["Naturally, {name}. Only the finest for you."] = "Naturalmente, {name}. Solo lo mejor para ti."
L["For you, {name}? Of course. The sun gives freely."] = "¿Para ti, {name}? Por supuesto. El sol da sin reservas."
L["Patience, {name}. Radiance can't be rushed, only admired."] = "Paciencia, {name}. El esplendor no se apresura: se admira."
L["Of course, {name}. {buff}, delivered with impeccable posture."] = "Por supuesto, {name}. {buff}, con una postura impecable."
L["You asked nicely, {name}. In Silvermoon that counts for everything."] = "Lo pediste con elegancia, {name}. En Lunargenta, eso lo es todo."
L["One moment, {name}. I never cast anything without checking my hair."] = "Un momento, {name}. Nunca lanzo nada sin mirarme el pelo."
L["At once, {name}. Keeping someone waiting is so terribly unfashionable."] = "Al instante, {name}. Hacer esperar a alguien está tan pasado de moda..."
L["Anar'alah belore, {name}. May the sun guide you, and light your good side."] = "Anar'alah belore, {name}. Que el sol te guíe y realce tu mejor perfil."
L["Shorel'aran, {name}. Fight with elegance."] = "Shorel'aran, {name}. Lucha con elegancia."
L["Take this, {name}. Whatever happens out there is merely a setback."] = "Toma, {name}. Pase lo que pase ahí fuera, no es más que un contratiempo."
L["Everyone deserves to shine, {name}. Only a little less than me, of course."] = "Todo el mundo merece brillar, {name}. Un poquito menos que yo, claro."
L["The sun is with you, {name}. I simply held the door for it."] = "El sol está contigo, {name}. Yo solo le abrí la puerta."
L["Go on, {name}, take it. The Sunwell's back; we can afford to be generous."] = "Anda, {name}, tómalo. La Fuente del Sol volvió; podemos ser generosos."
L["For you, {name}: {buff}, lightly scented with Silvermoon."] = "Para ti, {name}: {buff}, con aroma de Lunargenta."
L["Here, {name}. Hand-cast in Silvermoon, so do try not to scuff it."] = "Toma, {name}. Hecho a mano en Lunargenta: intenta no rayarlo."
L["The Sunwell shines for us both, {name}."] = "La Fuente del Sol brilla para ambos, {name}."
L["Two sin'dorei in one place, {name}. The day just got twice as elegant."] = "Dos sin'dorei juntos, {name}. El día acaba de ganar el doble de elegancia."
L["You too, {name}? Two sin'dorei, one mirror. We'll have to take turns."] = "¿Tú también, {name}? Dos sin'dorei, un espejo. Habrá que turnarse."
L["Like the phoenix, {name}: we keep rising, and we look good doing it."] = "Como el fénix, {name}: siempre renacemos, y con estilo."
L["Do keep pace, {name}. We have a reputation for arriving beautifully."] = "No te quedes atrás, {name}. Tenemos fama de hacer grandes entradas."
L["Stand where the light is good, {name}. If we must fight, we'll look splendid."] = "Ponte donde haya buena luz, {name}. Si hay que luchar, que sea con esplendor."
L["A party at last, {name}. I did dress for one."] = "Por fin un grupo, {name}. Y yo que me vestí de fiesta."
L["The sun shines on all of us, {name}. Mostly on me, but it shares."] = "El sol brilla para todos, {name}. Sobre todo para mí, pero comparte."
L["One for you, {name}, and one for the party's image, which I've taken on myself."] = "Uno para ti, {name}, y otro para la imagen del grupo, de la que me encargo yo."
L["The sun has risen, {name}, and so have I. We coordinate."] = "Salió el sol, {name}, y yo con él. Nos coordinamos."
L["Dawn over Quel'Thalas is lovelier, {name}, but this will do. Just."] = "El amanecer en Quel'Thalas es más bello, {name}, pero este sirve. Apenas."
L["Morning light, {name}. The most flattering hour. For both of us, naturally."] = "Luz matinal, {name}. La hora más favorecedora. Para ti y para mí, claro."
L["Your generosity is noted, {name}. In triplicate. Suramar remembers its friends."] = "Tomo nota de tu generosidad, {name}. Por triplicado. Suramar recuerda a sus amigos."
L["Most gracious, {name}. Allow me to repay you in kind."] = "Muy gentil por tu parte, {name}. Permíteme corresponderte."
L["Thank you, {name}. Ten thousand years under a dome; I'm still practising that."] = "Gracias, {name}. Diez mil años bajo una cúpula; aún lo estoy practicando."
L["A gift with no favour owed? The court would faint. Thank you, {name}."] = "¿Un regalo sin deber favores? La corte se desmayaría. Gracias, {name}."
L["Returned, {name}. We keep careful accounts of kindness. And of slights."] = "Devuelto, {name}. Llevamos cuenta detallada de la bondad. Y de las ofensas."
L["I'll mention you to First Arcanist Thalyssra, {name}. Favourably, even."] = "Le hablaré de ti a la primera arcanista Thalyssra, {name}. Y bien, incluso."
L["Most kind, {name}. In Suramar we'd hold a banquet. Consider it held."] = "Muy amable, {name}. En Suramar daríamos un banquete. Dalo por celebrado."
L["I'd send a formal letter of thanks, {name}, but this seemed quicker."] = "Te escribiría una carta de gratitud, {name}, pero esto es más rápido."
L["Of course, {name}. A little arcane polish, just for you."] = "Por supuesto, {name}. Un poco de lustre arcano, solo para ti."
L["A reasonable request, {name}. Granted."] = "Petición razonable, {name}. Concedida."
L["Certainly, {name}. The short version; the long one takes a lunar cycle."] = "Por supuesto, {name}. La versión corta; la larga dura un ciclo lunar."
L["A request, how refreshing. The court only ever made demands. Here, {name}."] = "Una petición, qué refrescante. La corte solo exigía. Toma, {name}."
L["Done, {name}, and free. Elisande would have charged you a favour for it."] = "Hecho, {name}, y gratis. Elisande te habría cobrado un favor."
L["There, {name}. No need to bow. A small nod would be lovely, though."] = "Ya está, {name}. No te inclines. Aunque un poquito sería un detalle."
L["Of course, {name}. I've perfected this since before most cities had walls."] = "Claro, {name}. Lo pulo desde antes de que existieran las murallas."
L["Take this, {name}. Arcane gifts are wasted on the idle."] = "Toma, {name}. Los dones arcanos se desperdician en los ociosos."
L["A spark of Suramar's arcana for you, {name}. Use it wisely."] = "Una chispa del saber arcano de Suramar, {name}. Úsala bien."
L["I've gone without magic once, {name}. I don't recommend it. Take this."] = "Ya pasé una vez sin magia, {name}. No lo recomiendo. Toma."
L["The world outside the dome is so large, {name}. And so under-enchanted. Here."] = "El mundo fuera de la cúpula es enorme, {name}. Y tan desencantado. Toma."
L["Arcwine is traditional, {name}, but {buff} travels better."] = "Lo tradicional es el vino arcano, {name}, pero {buff} viaja mejor."
L["Do take this, {name}. It's rude to refuse Suramar's hospitality. Very rude."] = "Acéptalo, {name}. Es grosero rechazar la hospitalidad de Suramar. Muy grosero."
L["Here, {name}. I'm told this is how outsiders say hello. Charming custom."] = "Toma, {name}. Me dicen que así saludan los de fuera. Encantadora costumbre."
L["Take this, {name}. Magic hoarded is magic spoiled, as Suramar learned."] = "Toma, {name}. Magia acaparada, magia echada a perder: Suramar lo aprendió."
L["Suramar's children shine together again, {name}."] = "Los hijos de Suramar vuelven a brillar juntos, {name}."
L["Shal'dorei, {name}! You packed arcwine? Outsider wine is just... grapes."] = "¡Shal'dorei, {name}! ¿Trajiste vino arcano? El vino de fuera es solo... uva."
L["Suramar's own, {name}. Try not to be too impressed by the rest of the world."] = "Sangre de Suramar, {name}. Que el resto del mundo no te impresione mucho."
L["We survived the Legion and the withering, {name}. The rest is small talk."] = "Sobrevivimos a la Legión y a la abstinencia, {name}. Lo demás son minucias."
L["An expedition, {name}! In Suramar this needed six permits and a masquerade."] = "¡Una expedición, {name}! En Suramar harían falta seis permisos y una mascarada."
L["The dome kept us safe, {name}. Now we must make do with one another. Gladly."] = "La cúpula nos protegía, {name}. Ahora nos cuidamos entre todos. Con gusto."
L["Arcane for everyone, {name}. The court would call it waste. I call it company."] = "Arcano para todos, {name}. La corte lo llamaría derroche. Yo lo llamo compañía."
L["Do follow my lead, {name}. I've had ten thousand years of walking in step."] = "Sigue mis pasos, {name}. Llevo diez mil años marcando el paso."
L["In a party one shares one's magic, {name}. How novel. I rather like it."] = "En grupo, uno comparte su magia, {name}. Qué novedad. Me gusta bastante."
L["Night at last, {name}. Add a few thousand lanterns and it's nearly Suramar."] = "Por fin de noche, {name}. Unos miles de faroles más y casi es Suramar."
L["Under the dome it was always night, {name}. I feel quite at home."] = "Bajo la cúpula siempre era de noche, {name}. Me siento como en casa."
L["The stars are out, {name}. We had better ones in Suramar. These will do."] = "Hay estrellas, {name}. Las de Suramar eran mejores. Estas servirán."
L["Daylight, {name}. Ten thousand years under a dome, and it still startles me."] = "Luz del día, {name}. Diez mil años bajo una cúpula, y aún me sobresalta."
L["An early hour, {name}. The court never rose before noon. I'm reforming."] = "Qué temprano, {name}. La corte no madrugaba nunca. Me estoy reformando."
L["Morning, {name}. The sun here is so very... unenchanted. Take this instead."] = "Buenos días, {name}. El sol de aquí es tan... poco encantador. Mejor esto."
L["A favour for a favour, {name}! Pleasure doing business."] = "¡Favor por favor, {name}! Un placer hacer negocios."
L["Thanks, {name}! Consider your account settled in full."] = "¡Gracias, {name}! Tu cuenta queda saldada por completo."
L["Aw, {name}. I'd invoice you, but I'm feeling sentimental. It'll pass."] = "Ay, {name}. Te facturaría, pero estoy sentimental. Ya se me pasará."
L["Thanks, {name}! I checked it for fine print. There wasn't any. Weird!"] = "¡Gracias, {name}! Busqué la letra pequeña. No había. ¡Qué raro!"
L["Returned with interest, {name}. Minus the interest. Don't get used to it."] = "Devuelto con intereses, {name}. Sin los intereses. No te acostumbres."
L["Much obliged, {name}! You've just been upgraded to preferred customer."] = "¡Mil gracias, {name}! Acabas de ascender a cliente preferente."
L["I'd name a rocket after you, {name}, but my rockets never last long. Thanks!"] = "Le pondría tu nombre a un cohete, {name}, pero mis cohetes duran poco. ¡Gracias!"
L["I'd have charged fifty gold for that, {name}. Let's call us even."] = "Yo habría cobrado cincuenta de oro, {name}. Quedamos en paz."
L["You got it, {name}! Time is money, friend!"] = "¡Marchando, {name}! ¡El tiempo es oro!"
L["Deal, {name}! I'll put it on your tab. Kidding!"] = "¡Trato hecho, {name}! Te lo cobro luego. ¡Es broma!"
L["Right away, {name}! Satisfaction guaranteed or your {buff} back."] = "¡Ahora mismo, {name}! Satisfacción garantizada o te devolvemos {buff}."
L["{buff}, {name}! Tips optional. Encouraged. Optional."] = "¡{buff}, {name}! Propina opcional. Recomendada. Opcional."
L["Fast, cheap or good, {name}? Today you get all three. Don't spread it around."] = "¿Rápido, barato o bueno, {name}? Hoy, las tres cosas. No lo vayas contando."
L["Sure thing, {name}! No explosions this time, I promise. Mostly promise."] = "¡Claro, {name}! Esta vez sin explosiones, lo prometo. Casi lo prometo."
L["For you, {name}? No charge. Put that in writing and I'll deny it."] = "¿Para ti, {name}? Gratis. Si lo pones por escrito, lo negaré."
L["This one's on the house, {name}. Don't tell the Trade Prince."] = "Invita la casa, {name}. Que no se entere el Príncipe Mercante."
L["Top-shelf stuff, zero fees, {name}. Today only!"] = "De primera y sin comisiones, {name}. ¡Solo hoy!"
L["Free sample, {name}! If you like it, you know where to find me."] = "¡Muestra gratis, {name}! Si te gusta, ya sabes dónde encontrarme."
L["Here, {name}. If anything explodes near you today, that was unrelated."] = "Toma, {name}. Si hoy explota algo cerca de ti, no tiene nada que ver."
L["Goodwill's an asset, {name}. Here's some {buff} for my books."] = "La buena fama cotiza, {name}. Toma {buff}: va al balance."
L["Take this, {name}. Safety first! Or third. It's on the list somewhere."] = "Toma, {name}. ¡La seguridad es lo primero! O lo tercero. Está en la lista."
L["Cast in record time, {name}! The record's mine. I set it just now."] = "¡Lanzado en tiempo récord, {name}! El récord es mío. Lo acabo de batir."
L["Kaja'Cola gives you ideas, {name}. This does the rest. Take it!"] = "Kaja'Cola te da ideas, {name}. Esto hace el resto. ¡Tómalo!"
L["Anything for a fellow entrepreneur, {name}!"] = "¡Entre emprendedores hay que ayudarse, {name}!"
L["Kezan's finest, together again, {name}. Keep a hand on your coin purse."] = "Lo mejorcito de Kezan, reunido otra vez, {name}. Ojo con tu bolsa."
L["Fellow goblin, {name}? Then you know this is a very, very rare discount."] = "¿Colega goblin, {name}? Entonces sabes que este descuento es rarísimo."
L["Goblins look after goblins, {name}. It's cheaper than hiring guards."] = "Entre goblins nos cuidamos, {name}. Sale más barato que pagar guardias."
L["Group rate, {name}! Everybody here gets it half off. Of free."] = "¡Tarifa de grupo, {name}! Todos a mitad de precio. De gratis."
L["Nobody dies on my contract, {name}. The paperwork's a nightmare."] = "Nadie muere bajo mi contrato, {name}. El papeleo es una pesadilla."
L["We split the loot even, {name}. I'll do the maths. Trust me."] = "El botín a partes iguales, {name}. Yo hago las cuentas. Confía en mí."
L["Team-building, {name}! You make everybody stronger, and they all owe you."] = "¡Espíritu de equipo, {name}! Haces a todos más fuertes, y todos te deben una."
L["Stick together, {name}. Mercenaries cost gold; friends only cost this."] = "No te separes, {name}. Los mercenarios cuestan oro; los amigos, solo esto."
L["Early bird gets the gold, {name}! Here's a freebie. Don't tell the other birds."] = "¡A quien madruga, el oro le ayuda, {name}! Invito. Ni una palabra a los dormilones."
L["Morning, {name}! Markets open in an hour. Until then, I'm feeling generous."] = "¡Buenos días, {name}! Los mercados abren en una hora. Hasta entonces, invito yo."
L["Up early, {name}? Smart. Time is money, and it's cheapest in the morning."] = "¿Madrugas, {name}? Bien. El tiempo es oro, y a primera hora sale más barato."
L["Thank you, {name}! The caravan always repays a kindness. Usually in string."] = "¡Gracias, {name}! La caravana siempre devuelve un favor. Suele ser en cordel."
L["How kind, {name}! You're on the caravan's good list now."] = "¡Qué detalle, {name}! Ya estás en la lista buena de la caravana."
L["Oh, I'll keep this, {name}! I keep everything. Here's one for you."] = "¡Uy, esto me lo quedo, {name}! Me lo quedo todo. Toma, uno para ti."
L["Thanks, {name}! Here's yours back. Well, a new one. Hardly used."] = "¡Gracias, {name}! Aquí va el tuyo. Bueno, otro. Casi sin usar."
L["My ears just went straight up, {name}. That means I'm very pleased."] = "Mira mis orejas, {name}: tiesas del todo. Eso es alegría pura."
L["By tonight's campfire, {name}, this story will have a sandworm in it. Thanks!"] = "En la hoguera de esta noche, {name}, la historia tendrá un gusano de arena. ¡Gracias!"
L["I'd gift-wrap yours, {name}, but all my wrapping is somebody's old map."] = "Te lo envolvería, {name}, pero todo mi papel de regalo es un mapa ajeno."
L["The alpacas saw that, {name}. They'll tell everyone how nice you are. Thanks!"] = "Las alpacas lo vieron, {name}. Contarán a todos lo buena gente que eres. ¡Gracias!"
L["Of course, {name}! Shake the sand out and hold still."] = "¡Claro, {name}! Sacúdete la arena y no te muevas."
L["Coming right up, {name}! Caravan service, no waiting."] = "¡Ahora mismo, {name}! Servicio de caravana, sin esperas."
L["Sure, {name}! Let me dig it out... rope, rocks, a nice rock... here it is!"] = "¡Claro, {name}! Déjame buscar... cuerda, piedras, una piedra bonita... ¡aquí está!"
L["Hold on, {name}! Tail's in the way, one moment... there!"] = "¡Espera, {name}! La cola me estorba, un momento... ¡ya!"
L["One {buff}, {name}! Only slightly sandy."] = "¡{buff}, {name}! Con solo un poquito de arena."
L["Ask a vulpera and you'll get something, {name}. Usually odd. Not today!"] = "Pide a un vulpera y algo te dará, {name}. Suele ser raro. ¡Hoy no!"
L["Yours, {name}! Vulpera love giving things. Almost as much as finding them."] = "¡Tuyo, {name}! A los vulpera nos encanta regalar. Casi tanto como encontrar."
L["Every traveller needs something for the road, {name}. I checked: not a rock."] = "Todo viajero necesita algo para el camino, {name}. Lo comprobé: no es una piedra."
L["Keep this, {name}. The desert is long and the water is short."] = "Guarda esto, {name}. El desierto es largo y el agua, escasa."
L["Found this lying around, {name}. Kidding! It's fresh. Take it!"] = "Lo encontré por ahí tirado, {name}. ¡Es broma! Es nuevo. ¡Toma!"
L["Here, {name}. Best thing in my pack, and I've got a lot of pack."] = "Toma, {name}. Lo mejor de mi mochila, y mi mochila da para mucho."
L["In the dunes you share your shade and your spells, {name}. Here."] = "En las dunas se comparte la sombra y los hechizos, {name}. Toma."
L["Some {buff} for you, {name}. I'd haggle, but you look busy."] = "Algo de {buff} para ti, {name}. Regatearía, pero se te ve con prisa."
L["A gift from the whole caravan, {name}! They'll never know."] = "¡Un regalo de toda la caravana, {name}! Nunca se enterarán."
L["For the road, {name}. Roads are the best part. Roads, and snacks."] = "Para el camino, {name}. Los caminos son lo mejor. Eso y picar algo."
L["A fellow wanderer! The caravan is never far, {name}."] = "¡Otro trotamundos! La caravana nunca anda lejos, {name}."
L["Ears up, {name}! Always nice to share a spell with a fellow fox."] = "¡Orejas arriba, {name}! Entre zorros da gusto compartir hechizos."
L["One vulpera to another, {name}: I've three spare spoons if you need one."] = "De vulpera a vulpera, {name}: tengo tres cucharas de sobra, por si acaso."
L["Vol'dun raised us both, {name}. Sand in the fur, luck in the pack."] = "Vol'dun nos crió, {name}. Arena en el pelaje, suerte en la mochila."
L["Caravan rules, {name}: stay together, share the water, nobody sells the alpaca."] = "Leyes de caravana, {name}: ir juntos, compartir el agua, y la alpaca no se vende."
L["Anything shiny in there, {name}, I saw it first. Caravan law."] = "Lo que brille ahí dentro, {name}, lo vi yo primero. Ley de caravana."
L["One for the party, {name}! A caravan's only as fast as its slowest alpaca."] = "¡Uno para el grupo, {name}! Una caravana va tan rápido como su alpaca más lenta."
L["Keep your pack shut, {name}. I don't mean to take things. They follow me."] = "Cierra la mochila, {name}. No es que me lleve cosas: me siguen solas."
L["Lost in a city, {name}, never in a cave. Caves are just houses with no rent."] = "En una ciudad me pierdo, {name}; en una cueva, jamás. Son casas sin alquiler."
L["We vulpera travel by night, {name}. Cool sand, sleepy scorpids."] = "Los vulpera viajamos de noche, {name}. Arena fresca, escórpidos dormidos."
L["Desert nights get cold, {name}. Here, something warm-ish."] = "Las noches del desierto hielan, {name}. Toma, algo tibio. Casi."
L["Stars out, {name}. Every one's a signpost if you know how to read it. I don't."] = "Hay estrellas, {name}. Cada una es una señal si sabes leerla. Yo no sé."
L["A kindness returned is a kindness doubled, {name}."] = "Bondad devuelta, bondad doblada, {name}."
L["Thank you, {name}. You have restored my balance."] = "Gracias, {name}. Me devolviste el equilibrio."
L["Somewhere, a Sha just went hungry. Thank you, {name}."] = "En algún lugar, un sha se quedó con hambre. Gracias, {name}."
L["Thank you, {name}. Aysa would bow, Ji would cheer. I will do both, badly."] = "Gracias, {name}. Aysa haría una reverencia; Ji, una fiesta. Yo, las dos, y mal."
L["Thank you, {name}. I will think of you at my next meal, and the one after."] = "Gracias, {name}. Pensaré en ti en mi próxima comida, y en la siguiente."
L["Chen always said: never refuse a gift. Or a drink. Thank you, {name}."] = "Chen siempre decía: nunca rechaces un regalo. Ni una copa. Gracias, {name}."
L["I was about to nap, {name}, but this is better. Slightly. Thank you."] = "Iba a echarme la siesta, {name}, pero esto es mejor. Un poco. Gracias."
L["A hozen would have thrown something, {name}. I was raised better. Thank you."] = "Un hozen te habría tirado algo, {name}. A mí me educaron mejor. Gracias."
L["Of course, {name}. Patience, and it is done. Patience is the slow part."] = "Claro, {name}. Paciencia y listo. La paciencia es la parte lenta."
L["With pleasure, {name}. A kind deed is never wasted."] = "Un placer, {name}. Hacer el bien nunca es en vano."
L["At once, {name}. Quick for a pandaren, which is not saying much."] = "Al instante, {name}. Rápido para un pandaren, que no es decir mucho."
L["Master Shang Xi said: help whoever asks, {name}. He also said: duck."] = "El maestro Shang Xi decía: ayuda a quien lo pida, {name}. Y también: agáchate."
L["A Tushui master would make you meditate first, {name}. I will skip that part."] = "Un maestro Tushui te haría meditar antes, {name}. Esa parte me la salto."
L["Anything for you, {name}. Except the last dumpling. Let us not be silly."] = "Lo que sea por ti, {name}. Menos el último bollito. No digamos tonterías."
L["One {buff}, {name}, brewed strong. The recipe stays a secret."] = "{buff} de la casa, {name}, con cuerpo. La receta es secreta."
L["Take this, {name}. And perhaps a cup of tea afterward?"] = "Toma, {name}. ¿Y luego quizá una taza de té?"
L["Balance in all things, {name}. Now go with a light heart."] = "Equilibrio en todo, {name}. Ahora ve con el corazón ligero."
L["Take this, {name}. A grummle would sell it to you for a luckydo."] = "Toma, {name}. Un grummel te lo vendería por un amuleto de la suerte."
L["The jinyu say the waters foretold this, {name}. They say that a lot."] = "Los jinyu dicen que las aguas lo predijeron, {name}. Lo dicen mucho."
L["The Huojin say act first. The Tushui say think first. I say: here, {name}."] = "Los Huojin dicen: actúa. Los Tushui dicen: piensa. Yo digo: toma, {name}."
L["A pandaren stood up to give you this, {name}. Treasure it."] = "Un pandaren se levantó para darte esto, {name}. Atesóralo."
L["Fight like a monk, {name}: calm, quick, and then a long lunch."] = "Pelea como un monje, {name}: calma, rapidez y después, comida larga."
L["Go gently, {name}. The turtle got where it was going and never hurried once."] = "Ve con calma, {name}. La tortuga llegó a su destino sin correr ni una vez."
L["We must share a brew when the road allows, {name}!"] = "¡Cuando el camino lo permita, una cerveza juntos, {name}!"
L["Shen-zin Su would be proud of us both, {name}. Or asleep. Hard to tell."] = "Shen-zin Su estaría orgulloso de nosotros, {name}. O dormido. Cuesta saberlo."
L["Two pandaren together, {name}. Somewhere, an innkeeper just felt a chill."] = "Dos pandaren juntos, {name}. Algún posadero acaba de sentir un escalofrío."
L["Liu Lang would approve, {name}: two of us, both a long way from home."] = "Liu Lang lo aprobaría, {name}: dos de los nuestros, muy lejos de casa."
L["A fight, then a meal, {name}. That is the correct order. Never the reverse."] = "Primero la pelea y luego la comida, {name}. Ese es el orden. Nunca al revés."
L["Stay together, {name}, like dumplings in a steamer. Warm, and ready."] = "No nos separemos, {name}, como bollitos en la vaporera. Calentitos y a punto."
L["We move as one, {name}. Slowly, perhaps, but as one."] = "Nos movemos como uno, {name}. Despacio, quizá, pero como uno."
L["Balance, {name}: one fights, one heals, and one carries the snacks. Me."] = "Equilibrio, {name}: uno lucha, otro cura y otro lleva la merienda. Yo."
L["If we fall, {name}, we fall together, and then we nap. Let us not."] = "Si caemos, {name}, caemos juntos, y luego una siesta. Mejor que no."
L["Up before the tea, {name}? Brave. Here, instead of the tea."] = "¿En pie antes del té, {name}? Qué valor. Toma, en lugar del té."
L["Morning, {name}. First this, then breakfast, then the second breakfast."] = "Buenos días, {name}. Primero esto, luego desayuno, y luego el segundo."
L["A new day, {name}, and nobody has spilled anything yet. Let us begin gently."] = "Un nuevo día, {name}, y nadie derramó nada todavía. Empecemos con suavidad."
L["Past my first nap, {name}, and before my second. Quickly, while I'm awake."] = "Entre mi primera siesta y la segunda, {name}. Rápido, antes de que me duerma."
L["Late, {name}. The brewmasters are asleep. The brews, I suspect, are not."] = "Es tarde, {name}. Los maestros cerveceros duermen. Las cervezas, sospecho, no."
L["Midnight snack time, {name}. This is the appetiser."] = "Hora de asaltar la despensa, {name}. Esto es el aperitivo."
L["Your kindness is noted, {name}. Dragons do not forget."] = "No olvidaré tu bondad, {name}. Los dragones nunca olvidan."
L["Thank you, {name}. Returned on swift wings."] = "Gracias, {name}. Te lo devuelvo con alas veloces."
L["Wings, fire and scales, {name}, and still you thought I needed help. Touching."] = "Alas, fuego y escamas, {name}, y aun así pensaste que necesitaba ayuda. Qué detalle."
L["I would bow, {name}, but last time my wings cleared a table. Thank you."] = "Me inclinaría, {name}, pero la última vez mis alas barrieron una mesa. Gracias."
L["That goes straight into my hoard, {name}. Kind deeds are the only gold I keep."] = "Esto va directo a mi tesoro, {name}. Las buenas obras son el único oro que guardo."
L["I was made to be a weapon, {name}. I much prefer this part. Thank you."] = "Me crearon para ser un arma, {name}. Prefiero mucho más esta parte. Gracias."
L["Thank you, {name}. Wrathion would have made a speech of it. I will not."] = "Gracias, {name}. Wrathion habría soltado un discurso. Yo no."
L["Returned with a little fire in it, {name}. Only a little. I am practising."] = "Te lo devuelvo con un poco de fuego, {name}. Solo un poco. Estoy practicando."
L["Very well, {name}. Stand still, I would hate to singe you."] = "Muy bien, {name}. No te muevas, no quisiera chamuscarte."
L["Granted, {name}. A dragon keeps its word."] = "Concedido, {name}. Un dragón cumple su palabra."
L["Certainly, {name}. Stand clear of the tail."] = "Desde luego, {name}. Aléjate de la cola."
L["Of course, {name}. Is this still how it is done? I was asleep for a while."] = "Por supuesto, {name}. ¿Esto aún se hace así? Dormí un ratito."
L["Gladly, {name}. All five dragonflights are in me, and all five say yes."] = "Con gusto, {name}. Llevo dentro los cinco vuelos, y los cinco dicen que sí."
L["Right away, {name}. Dragon-sized help, in a conveniently smaller form."] = "Enseguida, {name}. Ayuda de tamaño dragón, en formato de bolsillo."
L["Of course, {name}. Neltharion only gave orders. A request is much nicer."] = "Claro, {name}. Neltharion solo daba órdenes. Una petición se agradece más."
L["Take this, {name}. Even a dragon needs allies. Especially one this size."] = "Toma, {name}. Hasta un dragón necesita aliados. Y más uno de este tamaño."
L["A gift from the Dragon Isles, {name}. Fly well."] = "Un regalo de las Islas Dragón, {name}. Buen vuelo."
L["Alexstrasza says every life is precious, {name}. I am starting with yours."] = "Alexstrasza dice que toda vida es valiosa, {name}. Empiezo por la tuya."
L["I slept through ten thousand years of good deeds, {name}. Catching up now."] = "Me perdí diez mil años de buenas obras, {name}. Ahora me pongo al día."
L["Tell them a dragon did this, {name}. It sounds far grander than it was."] = "Cuenta que fue obra de un dragón, {name}. Suena más épico de lo que fue."
L["Scalecommander's orders, {name}. I am not a Scalecommander, but still."] = "Orden del comandante de escamas, {name}. O mía, pero suena mejor."
L["Take this, {name}. Ancient dragon magic, only slightly out of date."] = "Toma, {name}. Magia dracónica ancestral, apenas algo caducada."
L["A dragon giving, {name}, not taking. I am trying something new."] = "Un dragón que da en vez de saquear, {name}. Pruebo algo nuevo."
L["The Forbidden Reach feels far behind us now, {name}."] = "Nuestro largo letargo ya queda muy atrás, {name}."
L["Two dracthyr in one place, {name}. Mind the wings; there is not room for four."] = "Dos dracthyr juntos, {name}. Cuidado con las alas: aquí no caben cuatro."
L["Remember when the whole world was new to us, {name}? It still is, mostly."] = "¿Recuerdas cuando el mundo entero nos era nuevo, {name}? Casi todo aún lo es."
L["In visage form nobody can tell, {name}. Between us: we look better in scales."] = "En forma humanoide nadie lo nota, {name}. Entre tú y yo: con escamas lucimos más."
L["Tell me when to breathe fire, {name}. And, please, when not to."] = "Avísame cuándo echar fuego, {name}. Y, por favor, cuándo no."
L["I woke in a cave full of strangers, {name}. This is far better company."] = "Desperté en una cueva llena de extraños, {name}. Esta compañía es mejor."
L["Neltharion made us to fight alone, {name}. We have improved on him."] = "Neltharion nos diseñó para luchar a solas, {name}. Mejoramos el diseño."
L["Stay clear of my tail, {name}. It hasn't yet learned whose side it's on."] = "No te acerques a mi cola, {name}. Aún no sabe de qué bando está."
L["A flight of our own, {name}. So this is what the dragons meant."] = "Un vuelo propio, {name}. Así que a esto se referían los dragones."
L["It is good to see one of our own, {name}."] = "Da gusto ver a alguien de los nuestros, {name}."
L["Our people are few, {name}. That makes each of us count."] = "Somos pocos, {name}. Por eso cada uno cuenta."
L["Thank you, {name}. The Alliance looks after its own, and today that's me."] = "Gracias, {name}. La Alianza cuida de los suyos, y hoy me tocó a mí."
L["Kindness answered, {name}. For the Alliance!"] = "Bondad correspondida, {name}. ¡Por la Alianza!"
L["Stormwind has a statue for every hero, {name}. I'm putting in a word for yours."] = "Ventormenta tiene estatuas para cada héroe, {name}. Propondré la tuya."
L["The Alliance way, {name}: you help me, I help you, a dwarf buys the drinks."] = "Así es la Alianza, {name}: tú me ayudas, yo te ayudo y un enano invita."
L["Genn would growl, Muradin would hug, {name}. I'll just return it."] = "Genn gruñiría, Muradin te abrazaría, {name}. Yo solo te lo devuelvo."
L["If the Alliance gave medals for manners, {name}, you'd need a second tabard."] = "Si la Alianza premiara los modales, {name}, necesitarías otro tabardo."
L["Returned in full, {name}. An ally who gives first is worth a whole garrison."] = "Devuelto con creces, {name}. Quien da primero vale por toda una guarnición."
L["Of course, {name}. Allies help each other. It's practically in the name."] = "Por supuesto, {name}. Los aliados se ayudan. Va en el nombre."
L["At once, {name}. The Alliance does not leave a friend wanting."] = "Al instante, {name}. La Alianza no desampara a los suyos."
L["Of course, {name}. It's in the Alliance charter. Somewhere near the back."] = "Claro, {name}. Viene en la carta de la Alianza. Por el final, en letra pequeña."
L["By order of the Alliance, {name}: one {buff}, effective at once."] = "Por orden de la Alianza, {name}: {buff}, con efecto inmediato."
L["Anything for an ally, {name}. Within reason. This is well within reason."] = "Lo que sea entre aliados, {name}, dentro de lo razonable. Y esto lo es."
L["Right away, {name}. SI:7 knew you would ask. I only just found out."] = "Enseguida, {name}. El IV:7 sabía que lo pedirías. Yo me acabo de enterar."
L["For the Alliance, {name}! Stay strong out there. Stronger, now."] = "¡Por la Alianza, {name}! Mantente fuerte ahí fuera. Ahora, más aún."
L["Onward, {name}. The Alliance is with you."] = "Adelante, {name}. La Alianza está contigo."
L["Take this, {name}. Had a gnome made it, it would come with twelve levers."] = "Toma, {name}. Si lo hubiera hecho un gnomo, traería doce palancas."
L["Compliments of the Alliance, {name}. We've done these since the Second War."] = "Cortesía de la Alianza, {name}. Lo hacemos desde la Segunda Guerra."
L["Chin up, {name}. Somewhere in Stormwind, a bard is writing about this."] = "Ánimo, {name}. En Ventormenta ya hay un bardo escribiendo esto."
L["Every ally counts, {name}. I counted, actually. You're my favourite so far."] = "Cada aliado cuenta, {name}. Yo los conté. Y de momento vas en cabeza."
L["Anduin would want me to share, {name}, and I'd hate to disappoint him."] = "Anduin querría que compartiera, {name}, y no me gustaría decepcionarlo."
L["Together we stand, {name}. For the Alliance!"] = "Unidos resistimos, {name}. ¡Por la Alianza!"
L["Right, {name}: shields up, heads down, and nobody charges before the plan does."] = "Bien, {name}: escudos arriba, cabeza agachada y nadie carga antes que el plan."
L["The finest company the Alliance ever fielded, {name}. Or at least the nearest."] = "La mejor compañía que jamás reunió la Alianza, {name}. O la que tenía más a mano."
L["Together, {name}, we're practically a regiment. A small, well-dressed regiment."] = "Juntos, {name}, somos casi un regimiento. Uno pequeño y muy bien vestido."
L["Watch each other's backs, {name}. The Alliance was built by people who did."] = "Cubrámonos las espaldas, {name}. Así se construyó la Alianza."
L["Strength and honour, {name}. And kindness, it turns out. Repaid in full."] = "Fuerza y honor, {name}. Y bondad, por lo visto. Te lo devuelvo todo."
L["The Horde takes care of its own, {name}."] = "La Horda se ocupa de los suyos, {name}."
L["Strength given, strength returned, {name}. That's all of Horde diplomacy."] = "Fuerza dada, fuerza devuelta, {name}. Esa es toda la diplomacia de la Horda."
L["I'd carve your name on Orgrimmar's gates, {name}, but they're full. Thanks."] = "Grabaría tu nombre en las puertas de Orgrimmar, {name}, pero no cabe. Gracias."
L["Gallywix would've sent you an invoice, {name}. I'm sending this instead."] = "Gallywix te habría mandado la factura, {name}. Yo te mando esto."
L["You did not have to do that, {name}. That is why the Horde remembers it."] = "No tenías por qué hacerlo, {name}. Por eso la Horda lo recuerda."
L["In the Horde we do not say thank you twice, {name}. So: once, and meant."] = "En la Horda no damos las gracias dos veces, {name}. Así que una, y de corazón."
L["Consider it done, {name}. For the Horde, and for anyone who asks nicely."] = "Considéralo hecho, {name}. Por la Horda, y por quien lo pida con educación."
L["You only had to ask, {name}. The Horde answers."] = "Solo tenías que pedirlo, {name}. La Horda responde."
L["The Horde usually helps with axes, {name}. Today, {buff}."] = "La Horda suele ayudar a hachazos, {name}. Hoy, con {buff}."
L["Done, {name}. No speeches. The Horde has plenty of those already."] = "Hecho, {name}. Sin discursos. La Horda ya tiene de sobra."
L["You asked, {name}. In Orgrimmar, that counts as a formal treaty."] = "Lo pediste, {name}. En Orgrimmar, eso cuenta como tratado formal."
L["Asking is no weakness, {name}. Refusing an ally would be."] = "Pedir no es debilidad, {name}. Negarse a un aliado sí lo sería."
L["For the Horde, {name}! Go with strength. I've just handed you some."] = "¡Por la Horda, {name}! Ve con fuerza. Acabo de darte un poco."
L["Go with honour, {name}. Victory awaits."] = "Ve con honor, {name}. La victoria te espera."
L["Go and do something worth a song, {name}. Loud songs. The Horde likes loud."] = "Haz algo digno de una canción, {name}. A todo pulmón, como le gusta a la Horda."
L["Walk tall, {name}. The Horde always made room for those the world turned away."] = "Cabeza alta, {name}. La Horda siempre acogió a quien el mundo rechazó."
L["Take this, {name}, and a word of Horde wisdom: hit first, apologise never."] = "Toma, {name}, y un consejo de la Horda: pega primero y no pidas perdón nunca."
L["Victory or death, {name}. I'd prefer victory, so take this."] = "Victoria o muerte, {name}. Yo prefiero la victoria, así que toma."
L["Like a mak'gora, {name}, except everybody wins. Here."] = "Como un mak'gora, {name}, pero aquí ganamos todos. Toma."
L["Our strength is each other, {name}. For the Horde!"] = "Nuestra fuerza es la unión, {name}. ¡Por la Horda!"
L["Forward, {name}. The Horde advances together. Retreats... never, officially."] = "Adelante, {name}. La Horda avanza unida. ¿Retirarse? Oficialmente, nunca."
L["Together we're a war band, {name}. Apart, we're just loud."] = "Juntos, una partida de guerra, {name}. Por separado, solo ruido."
L["Shoulder to shoulder, {name}. Whoever charges first buys the grog."] = "Hombro con hombro, {name}. Quien cargue primero paga el grog."
L["Nobody gets left behind, {name}. I've counted us twice."] = "Aquí no se abandona a nadie, {name}. Nos conté dos veces."
L["Thank you, {name}. Good hearts turn up on every side, and apparently here."] = "Gracias, {name}. Hay buena gente en cada bando, y por lo visto también aquí."
L["Thank you, {name}. No side, no title, just kindness. Legends start like this."] = "Gracias, {name}. Sin bando ni título, solo bondad. Así empiezan las leyendas."
L["Thank you, {name}. Kindness has no faction, which is handy, since I have none."] = "Gracias, {name}. La bondad no tiene facción, y viene bien, porque yo tampoco."
L["Thank you, {name}. Whichever side gets you is getting a bargain."] = "Gracias, {name}. El bando que te fiche se lleva una ganga."
L["Whoever claims me in the end, {name}, I'll remember you first. Thank you."] = "Acabe en el bando que acabe, {name}, a ti te recordaré primero. Gracias."
L["Strictly neutral, {name}, but gratitude doesn't count. Thank you."] = "Soy estrictamente neutral, {name}, pero la gratitud no cuenta. Gracias."
L["Gladly, {name}, whatever banner you fly. I don't even own a banner."] = "Con gusto, {name}, sea cual sea tu estandarte. Yo ni tengo estandarte."
L["Certainly, {name}. I help everyone. It's the one thing I've decided."] = "Claro, {name}. Ayudo a todos. Es lo único que tengo decidido."
L["Everyone asks me which side I'm on, {name}. Much nicer to be asked for help."] = "Todos me preguntan de qué bando soy, {name}. Prefiero que me pidan ayuda."
L["Of course, {name}. No war council to ask; just me, and I say yes."] = "Claro, {name}. No hay consejo de guerra: solo yo, y digo que sí."
L["Here you are, {name}. No oath, no colours, no fee."] = "Toma, {name}. Sin juramento, sin colores, sin cobrar."
L["Friends can come from any side, {name}. Or, like me, from none in particular."] = "Hay amigos en todos los bandos, {name}. O, como yo, en ninguno en concreto."
L["Soon they'll hand us tabards, {name}. Until then, we look after each other."] = "Pronto nos darán tabardos, {name}. Mientras tanto, nos cuidamos entre nosotros."
L["I haven't chosen a side yet, {name}, so I'm being kind to both. Take this."] = "Aún no elegí bando, {name}, así que soy amable con los dos. Toma."
L["A gift with no strings, {name}. I don't even have a faction to tie them to."] = "Un regalo sin ataduras, {name}. Ni siquiera tengo facción a la que atarlo."
L["Go on, {name}. Two whole factions are waiting to argue over us."] = "Vamos, {name}. Dos facciones esperan para pelearse por nosotros."
L["No quartermaster yet, {name}, so nobody's counting. Have plenty."] = "Aún sin intendente, {name}, nadie lleva la cuenta. Toma de sobra."
L["Side by side, {name}, whatever comes."] = "Codo con codo, {name}, pase lo que pase."
L["No flag over this party, {name}, just us. That's plenty."] = "Sin bandera en este grupo, {name}, solo nosotros. Y basta."
L["One day we'll pick sides, {name}. Today we pick fights, together."] = "Algún día elegiremos bando, {name}. Hoy, a quién pegarle."
L["Whatever side the rest of the world is on, {name}, I'm on this party's."] = "Esté el mundo del bando que esté, {name}, yo estoy del de este grupo."
L["Neutral in the war, {name}, but very partial to this group."] = "Neutral en la guerra, {name}, pero muy parcial con este grupo."
L["One good turn deserves another, {name}."] = "Favor con favor se paga, {name}."
L["Have some {buff} in return, {name}."] = "Toma algo de {buff} a cambio, {name}."
L["Kindness should go both ways, {name}. Thank you."] = "La amabilidad tiene que ser mutua, {name}. Gracias."
L["You went first, {name}, so I'll go second and we'll call it friendship."] = "Tú diste el primer paso, {name}; yo doy el segundo. Eso es amistad."
L["I'd write you a song, {name}, but {buff} is less off-key."] = "Te escribiría una canción, {name}, pero {buff} desafina menos."
L["A gift for a gift, {name}. At this rate we'll be unstoppable by supper."] = "Regalo por regalo, {name}. A este ritmo, para la cena seremos imparables."
L["All square, {name}. Unless you'd like to make it best of three."] = "Estamos en paz, {name}. Salvo que quieras jugarlo al mejor de tres."
L["You started it, {name}. I'm only finishing it."] = "Tú empezaste, {name}. Yo solo lo termino."
L["That was kind, {name}. The day just got noticeably better. Here's my half."] = "Qué amable, {name}. El día acaba de mejorar bastante. Aquí va mi parte."
L["You asked, {name}, and here it is."] = "Lo pediste, {name}, y aquí lo tienes."
L["{buff}, coming right up, {name}."] = "{buff} en camino, {name}."
L["Gladly, {name}. One moment."] = "Con gusto, {name}. Un momento."
L["Asked and answered, {name}. Next question?"] = "Pedido y respondido, {name}. ¿Siguiente pregunta?"
L["Say the word and it's yours, {name}. You said several. Here."] = "Dime una palabra y es tuyo, {name}. Dijiste varias. Toma."
L["For you, {name}? Gladly. I was hoping someone would ask."] = "¿Para ti, {name}? Con gusto. Esperaba que alguien lo pidiera."
L["Of course, {name}. Easiest yes I'll say all day."] = "Claro, {name}. El sí más fácil que diré hoy."
L["Right away, {name}. Finally, a question I know the answer to."] = "Enseguida, {name}. Por fin una pregunta que sé responder."
L["Safe travels, {name}. {buff} packs lighter than a sword."] = "Buen viaje, {name}. {buff} pesa menos que una espada."
L["A small blessing for the road, {name}."] = "Una pequeña bendición para el camino, {name}."
L["Go well, {name}, and come back in one piece."] = "Ve con cuidado, {name}, y vuelve de una pieza."
L["No reason, {name}. It just felt like a {buff} sort of day."] = "Sin motivo, {name}. Hoy me pareció un día de {buff}."
L["Don't mind me, {name}. Just passing, with a spare {buff}."] = "No me hagas caso, {name}. Solo pasaba con {buff} de sobra."
L["Consider it a gift, {name}. I'd wrap it, but it glows through the paper."] = "Considéralo un regalo, {name}. Lo envolvería, pero brilla a través del papel."
L["Here, {name}. Pass it on when you meet someone who needs it."] = "Toma, {name}. Pásalo cuando encuentres a alguien que lo necesite."
L["Whatever brings you here, {name}, may it go better than planned."] = "Te traiga lo que te traiga, {name}, que salga mejor de lo previsto."
L["Just being neighbourly, {name}. Very, very temporary neighbours."] = "Cosas de vecinos, {name}. Vecinos muy, muy temporales."
L["Everyone ready? You are now, {name}."] = "¿Todos listos? Tú ya lo estás, {name}."
L["A little something for the party, {name}."] = "Un detallito para el grupo, {name}."
L["Stay close, {name}. We go further together."] = "No te alejes, {name}. Juntos llegamos más lejos."
L["House rules, {name}: nobody dies, nobody sulks, everybody eats after."] = "Normas de la casa, {name}: nadie muere, nadie refunfuña y luego, a comer."
L["There, {name}. Now if this goes badly, it won't be my fault."] = "Listo, {name}. Si esto sale mal, no será culpa mía."
L["All set, {name}. I'd give a speech, but we'd be here all day."] = "Todo listo, {name}. Daría un discurso, pero sería eterno."
L["Look after that, {name}. It's the only one I brought for you."] = "Cuídalo, {name}. Es el único que traje para ti."
L["Now we look the part, {name}. Let's go and be it."] = "Ya tenemos pinta de héroes, {name}. Ahora, a serlo."
L["Fresh {buff} all round, {name}. The rest is luck and elbows."] = "{buff} para todos, {name}. Lo demás es suerte y codazos."
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd conjure a gift in return, but it would only be water."] = "Gracias, {name}. Te conjuraría un regalo, pero solo me saldría agua."
L["Much obliged, {name}. I'll write it up properly later. Several pages."] = "Te lo agradezco, {name}. Luego lo documento como es debido. Varias páginas."
L["Thank you, {name}. They never taught gratitude at Dalaran. I'm self-taught."] = "Gracias, {name}. En Dalaran no enseñan gratitud. Soy autodidacta."
L["Kind of you, {name}. I'd say it went to my head, but that's my job."] = "Qué amable, {name}. Se me sube a la cabeza, pero ahí trabajo yo."
L["Of course, {name}. And yes, I suppose you'll want water as well."] = "Claro, {name}. Y sí, supongo que también querrás agua."
L["As requested, {name}. Side effects may include footnotes."] = "Como pediste, {name}. Efecto secundario: notas al pie."
L["At once, {name}. Carefully, too; I've blinked into two walls today."] = "Al momento, {name}. Ojo: hoy Traslación ya me estampó en dos muros."
L["Gladly, {name}. Knowledge should be shared. The Kirin Tor say so, reluctantly."] = "Con gusto, {name}. El saber se comparte. Lo dice el Kirin Tor, a regañadientes."
L["Here, {name}. I had a spare thought and nowhere to put it."] = "Toma, {name}. Me sobraba una idea y no sabía dónde ponerla."
L["Take this, {name}. I'd add bread, but conjured bread tastes of nothing."] = "Toma, {name}. Añadiría pan, pero el pan conjurado no sabe a nada."
L["{buff} for you, {name}. No charge, unlike the portals."] = "{buff} para ti, {name}. Gratis, no como los portales."
L["Here, {name}. Most folk I point at turn into sheep. Today's your lucky day."] = "Toma, {name}. Lo que señalo suele volverse oveja. Hoy estás de suerte."
L["Nothing on fire, nothing frozen, {name}. I'm branching out."] = "Nada en llamas, nada congelado, {name}. Me estoy diversificando."
L["Now that you're clever, {name}, stand between me and the angry things."] = "Ahora que te sobra ingenio, {name}, ponte entre las cosas furiosas y yo."
L["For the record, {name}, I only blink away when it's tactically sound."] = "Que conste, {name}: solo uso Traslación cuando es tácticamente correcto."
L["There, {name}. Wiser already: look, you're standing further from me."] = "Hecho, {name}. Ya se nota el ingenio: mira qué lejos de mí te pusiste."
L["Minds sharpened, {name}. I'll handle the fire, the frost and the panicking."] = "Mentes afiladas, {name}. Yo me encargo del fuego, la escarcha y el pánico."
L["How thoughtful, {name}. The Light keeps accounts; I settle mine early."] = "Qué detalle, {name}. La Luz lleva las cuentas; yo saldo las mías pronto."
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll put in a good word with the Light. It owes me several."] = "Gracias, {name}. Hablaré bien de ti a la Luz. Me debe varias."
L["Thank you, {name}. A small miracle, and I didn't even have to pray for it."] = "Gracias, {name}. Un pequeño milagro, y sin tener que rezar."
L["Thank you, {name}. My faith in people is restored. It was only resting."] = "Gracias, {name}. Recupero la fe en la gente. Solo estaba descansando."
L["Of course, {name}. The Light keeps no hours, and neither, sadly, do I."] = "Claro, {name}. La Luz no tiene horario, y yo, por desgracia, tampoco."
L["Straight away, {name}. Most prayers take longer; you've found a shortcut."] = "Enseguida, {name}. Casi todas las plegarias tardan más; encontraste un atajo."
L["Certainly, {name}. The Light shines on those who ask. I just aim it."] = "Desde luego, {name}. La Luz brilla sobre quien pide. Yo solo apunto."
L["With pleasure, {name}. Faith moves mountains; I'm starting smaller."] = "Un placer, {name}. La fe mueve montañas; yo empiezo por algo más pequeño."
L["Bless you, {name}. No, you didn't sneeze; I'm simply thorough."] = "¡Salud, {name}! No, no estornudaste: es que yo la reparto."
L["Here, {name}. Think of it as a prayer that arrived early."] = "Toma, {name}. Es una plegaria que llegó antes de tiempo."
L["The Light asked me to pass this along, {name}. I'm paraphrasing."] = "La Luz me pidió que te diera esto, {name}. Estoy parafraseando."
L["Take this, {name}. It saves us both an awkward resurrection later."] = "Toma, {name}. Así nos ahorramos una resurrección incómoda luego."
L["Freely given, {name}. Faith costs nothing. The robes, sadly, did."] = "Gratis, {name}. La fe no cuesta nada. La túnica, por desgracia, sí."
L["Your turn, {name}. Now, I beg you all: make my job boring."] = "Te toca, {name}. Y por favor, todos: que me aburra."
L["Everyone stay near me, {name}. The Light has a limited range."] = "Que nadie se aleje de mí, {name}. La Luz tiene un alcance limitado."
L["There, {name}. If anyone falls, I'll be very disappointed, then fix it."] = "Hecho, {name}. Si alguien cae, me llevaré un disgusto. Y luego lo arreglo."
L["Done, {name}. I'll be at the back, praying loudly."] = "Hecho, {name}. Estaré detrás, rezando a gritos."
L["Thank you, {name}. I'd purr, but I'm not in the right shape for it."] = "Gracias, {name}. Ronronearía, pero no estoy en forma."
L["Thanks, {name}. My bear form sends a grateful grunt."] = "Gracias, {name}. Mi forma de oso te gruñe agradecida."
L["Much obliged, {name}. My cat form wants to bring you a rabbit. I've said no."] = "Te lo agradezco, {name}. Mi forma felina quiere traerte un conejo. Le dije que no."
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll plant a tree in your honour. Give it a century."] = "Gracias, {name}. Plantaré un árbol en tu honor. Dale un siglo."
L["Certainly, {name}. Give me a moment to remember which shape has hands."] = "Desde luego, {name}. Dame un momento para recordar qué forma tiene manos."
L["Of course, {name}. Hold still, like an oak. Oaks are wonderful at it."] = "Claro, {name}. No te muevas, como un roble. Se les da de maravilla."
L["Gladly, {name}. The wild shares everything. Well, not the bears."] = "Con gusto, {name}. Lo salvaje lo comparte todo. Bueno, los osos no."
L["Right away, {name}. Pardon the feathers; I've just come from being an owl."] = "Enseguida, {name}. Perdona las plumas: hace nada era un búho."
L["Fresh from the Emerald Dream, {name}. Sorry if I yawn."] = "Vengo del Sueño Esmeralda, {name}. Perdona si bostezo."
L["Take this, {name}. Nature provides, and I'm its errand runner today."] = "Toma, {name}. La naturaleza provee, y hoy yo hago sus encargos."
L["The wild calls you friend now, {name}. Handy, since most of it has teeth."] = "Lo salvaje te acepta, {name}. Viene bien, porque casi todo tiene dientes."
L["I brought you flowers as well, {name}, but I was a stag at the time. Sorry."] = "También te traía flores, {name}, pero iba de ciervo y me las comí."
L["Here, {name}. Cenarius would want you to have it. I'm nearly sure."] = "Toma, {name}. Cenarius querría que lo tuvieras. Casi seguro."
L["Ready, {name}? Now, whatever happens, nobody startle the bear."] = "¿Todo a punto, {name}? Pase lo que pase, que nadie asuste al oso."
L["There, {name}. I'll be the cat, the bear or, if we must swim, the seal."] = "Hecho, {name}. Seré el gato, el oso o, si toca nadar, la foca."
L["I've one rebirth in me, {name}. Please, nobody make me choose."] = "Solo me queda un renacimiento, {name}. Que nadie me haga elegir."
L["Close ranks, {name}. The forest is watching, and it's rooting for us."] = "Cerremos filas, {name}. El bosque nos mira, y nos apoya de raíz."
L["Kindness, {name}? My favourite virtue. Just ahead of polishing."] = "¿Bondad, {name}? Mi virtud favorita. Por delante de sacar brillo."
L["For that, {name}, my best blessing. Not the second best. The best."] = "Por eso, {name}, mi mejor bendición. No la segunda mejor. La mejor."
L["Virtue rewarded on the spot, {name}! I do love it when that happens."] = "¡Virtud recompensada al instante, {name}! Me encanta cuando pasa."
L["Thank you, {name}. My oath says to repay kindness. I'd do it anyway."] = "Gracias, {name}. Mi juramento dice que devuelva la bondad. Lo haría igual."
L["By the Light, {name}, of course! I've been hoping somebody would ask."] = "¡Por la Luz, {name}, claro! Llevaba todo el día esperando esto."
L["You have my blessing, {name}. Literally, this time."] = "Tienes mi bendición, {name}. Literalmente, esta vez."
L["Certainly, {name}. Kneel if you like. I won't insist. I'll be delighted."] = "Desde luego, {name}. Arrodíllate si quieres. No insisto. Pero me encantaría."
L["Gladly, {name}. I never run short of blessings. Mana, now and then."] = "Con gusto, {name}. Nunca me faltan bendiciones. El maná, a veces."
L["The Light asks nothing in return, {name}. I, however, accept thanks."] = "La Luz no pide nada a cambio, {name}. Yo, en cambio, acepto las gracias."
L["Go with the Light, {name}. I'll be right behind you, clanking."] = "Ve con la Luz, {name}. Iré detrás; me oirás por el clanc clanc."
L["The blessing's free, {name}. You've been spared the sermon. This time."] = "La bendición es gratis, {name}. Y te ahorro el sermón. Por esta vez."
L["There, {name}. It won't last forever, so be heroic while it does."] = "Hecho, {name}. No dura para siempre: haz heroicidades mientras tanto."
L["Stand tall, {name}. The Light walks with you, and it has excellent posture."] = "Con la cabeza alta, {name}. La Luz camina contigo, y tiene una postura impecable."
L["You're blessed, {name}. If I bubble later, it's strictly tactical."] = "Bendición dada, {name}. Si luego hago la burbuja, es pura táctica."
L["Stand fast, {name}. We have the Light, and I have a very large hammer."] = "Aguanta firme, {name}. Tenemos la Luz, y yo tengo un martillo enorme."
L["One blessing each, {name}. The Light is generous, but it insists on turns."] = "Una bendición para cada uno, {name}. La Luz es generosa, pero exige turnos."
L["Splendid, {name}. Now, nobody look directly at me. I'm rather bright today."] = "Espléndido, {name}. Que nadie me mire directamente. Hoy estoy muy brillante."
L["How kind, {name}. My imp says thank you too. He's lying, but I'm not."] = "Qué amable, {name}. Mi diablillo te da las gracias. Miente; yo no."
L["Thank you, {name}. It's been ages since anyone gave me something uncursed."] = "Gracias, {name}. Hacía siglos que nadie me daba algo sin maldición."
L["Thank you, {name}. I'll repay you with something I didn't find in a crypt."] = "Gracias, {name}. Te lo pagaré con algo que no saqué de una cripta."
L["Most gracious, {name}. I've asked the voidwalker to stop looming at you."] = "Muy amable, {name}. Le pedí al abisario que deje de acecharte."
L["Of course, {name}. No soul required. This time."] = "Claro, {name}. No te pediré el alma. Esta vez."
L["You asked a warlock for help, {name}. Bold. I like you already."] = "¿Pedirle ayuda a la brujería, {name}? Qué valor. Ya me caes bien."
L["Of course, {name}. The imp offered to help, and I said no, for all our sakes."] = "Claro, {name}. El diablillo se ofreció; le dije que no, por el bien de todos."
L["Certainly, {name}. Of all my spells, this is the one I can do at parties."] = "Desde luego, {name}. De mis hechizos, es el único apto para fiestas."
L["Here, {name}. Don't ask where it came from. Really, don't."] = "Toma, {name}. No preguntes de dónde salió. En serio."
L["Fall in a lake someday, {name}, and you'll think of me fondly."] = "Si algún día caes en un lago, {name}, te acordarás de mí con cariño."
L["Breathe easy, {name}. I'd hate to lose you to anything as dull as water."] = "Respira hondo, {name}. Odiaría perderte por algo tan soso como el agua."
L["Here, {name}. You'll want a soulstone too, but that's a bigger conversation."] = "Toma, {name}. También querrás una piedra de alma, pero eso es otra conversación."
L["Take this, {name}. It's the only spell of mine the priests approve of."] = "Toma, {name}. Es el único hechizo mío que aprueban los sacerdotes."
L["Everyone ready, {name}? Souls intact? Good. Let's keep it that way."] = "¿Todos listos, {name}? ¿Almas intactas? Bien. Que siga así."
L["Stay close, {name}. The voidwalker takes the hits; I take the credit."] = "No te alejes, {name}. El abisario se lleva los golpes; yo, el mérito."
L["Swim all you like, {name}. If anyone drifts off, I'll summon them back."] = "Nada todo lo que quieras, {name}. Si alguien se pierde, lo invoco de vuelta."
L["Do pet the felhunter, {name}. Just take your spells off first."] = "Acaricia al manáfago, {name}. Pero quítate los hechizos antes."
L["Thank you, {name}! Sorry, was that loud? I only have the one volume."] = "¡Gracias, {name}! Perdón, ¿fue muy alto? Solo tengo un volumen."
L["Much obliged, {name}. No spells to give back, but I do a very sincere shout."] = "Gracias, {name}. No tengo hechizos que devolver, pero grito con sinceridad."
L["Thanks, {name}. Now I'm twice as angry. In the good way."] = "Gracias, {name}. Ahora tengo el doble de ira. De la buena."
L["Thanks, {name}. You've earned a place right behind me. Safest spot there is."] = "Gracias, {name}. Te ganaste un lugar justo detrás de mí. El más seguro que hay."
L["You want a shout, {name}? I was going to shout anyway."] = "¿Quieres un grito, {name}? Iba a gritar de todos modos."
L["Of course, {name}. Cover your ears; this is the only way I know how."] = "Claro, {name}. Tápate los oídos; no sé hacerlo de otra forma."
L["Right away, {name}. Stay in earshot. For me that's a generous distance."] = "Enseguida, {name}. Quédate donde me oigas. Conmigo, eso es bastante lejos."
L["Happily, {name}! Words aren't my strength. Volume is."] = "¡Claro, {name}! Hablar no es lo mío. Gritar, sí."
L["Consider yourself shouted at, {name}. Affectionately."] = "Te acabo de gritar, {name}. Con cariño."
L["No incense, no prayers, {name}. Just me, shouting encouragingly."] = "Sin incienso ni plegarias, {name}. Solo yo, gritando ánimos."
L["Chin up, {name}! If anything bothers you, I'll charge it."] = "¡Ánimo, {name}! Si algo te molesta, cargo contra ello."
L["There, {name}! Anything that doesn't feel braver now wasn't listening."] = "¡Listo, {name}! Quien no se sienta más valiente ahora, no estaba escuchando."
L["Here, {name}, some courage. Warriors make it by yelling. Don't ask how."] = "Toma valor, {name}. Lo fabricamos a gritos. No preguntes cómo."
L["Listen up, {name}! That's it. That was the whole speech."] = "¡Atención, {name}! Ya está. Ese era todo el discurso."
L["Where's the danger, {name}? Never mind, I'll find it. Face first."] = "¿Dónde está el peligro, {name}? Da igual, ya lo encuentro. De cara."
L["Right, {name}! I go first, I shout loudest, and nobody touches the healer."] = "¡Bien, {name}! Yo voy delante, yo grito más, y nadie toca al sanador."
L["Everybody angrier? Good. Onward, {name}, and mind my backswing."] = "¿Todos con más ira? Bien. Adelante, {name}, y cuidado con mi revés."
L["A sharper mind for you, {name}. Mine cost me an eyebrow in Dalaran."] = "Una mente más aguda para ti, {name}. La mía me costó una ceja en Dalaran."
L["More mana for you, {name}. Try not to spend it all on one fireball."] = "Más maná para ti, {name}. No te lo gastes todo en una bola de fuego."
L["Thoughts humming, {name}? Normal. If they hum back, come and find me."] = "¿Te zumban las ideas, {name}? Es normal. Si te contestan, ven a buscarme."
L["A little arcane for your thoughts, {name}. Keep the change."] = "Un poco de arcano por tus ideas, {name}. Quédate con el cambio."
L["Brilliance, bottled, {name}. The Kirin Tor would charge you for the bottle."] = "Genio embotellado, {name}. El Kirin Tor te cobraría la botella."
L["Sharper wits, {name}. Spend them on spells, locks or riddles; I won't judge."] = "Más ingenio, {name}. Gástalo en hechizos, cerraduras o acertijos; no juzgo."
L["Fortitude, {name}: a priest's polite way of saying 'stand in front'."] = "Entereza, {name}: el 'ponte delante' educado de un sacerdote."
L["Every bit of stamina is one less panicked prayer from me, {name}."] = "Cada punto de aguante me ahorra una plegaria desesperada, {name}."
L["Tougher already, {name}. Please don't take that as a dare."] = "Ya aguantas más, {name}. Por favor, no te lo tomes como un reto."
L["There are other Power Words, {name}. 'Shield', and in emergencies, 'Run'."] = "Hay otras Palabras de poder, {name}: 'escudo' y, en emergencias, 'corre'."
L["Sturdier now, {name}. Falls, bears and bad decisions all hurt a bit less."] = "Más resistencia, {name}. Caídas, osos y malas decisiones duelen un poco menos."
L["{buff}, {name}. Three words where 'be tougher' would do."] = "{buff}, {name}. Tantas palabras para decir 'aguanta'."
L["Consider your spirits lifted, {name}. Divinely, as it happens."] = "Espíritu por las nubes, {name}. Y divino, nada menos."
L["Like a good night's sleep, {name}, without all the lying down."] = "Como dormir ocho horas, {name}, pero sin tener que acostarte."
L["A second helping of spirit, {name}. The Light always insists on seconds."] = "Una ración extra de espíritu, {name}. La Luz siempre insiste en repetir."
L["Keep your spirit where it is, {name}. The Spirit Healers are busy enough."] = "Retén tu espíritu, {name}. El ángel del cementerio ya tiene bastante."
L["Proof against shadow, {name}. I know its tricks; I've borrowed a few."] = "Contra las sombras, {name}. Conozco sus trucos: tomé algunos prestados."
L["Should the Void call, {name}, you can now pretend you're out."] = "Si llama el Vacío, {name}, ahora puedes decir que no estás."
L["For when the dark gets personal, {name}. It usually does."] = "Para cuando la oscuridad se ensañe, {name}. Suele pasar."
L["The shadows will have to knock first now, {name}."] = "Las sombras tendrán que llamar antes, {name}."
L["Marked by the wild, {name}. The deer will tip their antlers as you pass."] = "Lo salvaje te marcó, {name}. Los ciervos te saludarán con la cornamenta."
L["You may smell faintly of moss, {name}. That's how you know it's working."] = "Puede que huelas un poco a musgo, {name}. Así sabes que funciona."
L["Mark of the Wild, {name}. The wolves will still bite, but they'll feel bad."] = "Marca de lo Salvaje, {name}. Los lobos morderán igual, pero con culpa."
L["The wild's own seal of approval, {name}. The squirrels were consulted."] = "El sello de aprobación de lo salvaje, {name}. Se consultó a las ardillas."
L["A little of the wild in you now, {name}. Resist the urge to howl."] = "Ahora llevas algo salvaje dentro, {name}. Resiste las ganas de aullar."
L["Hide, claw and a thick coat, {name}. The wild packs light but thorough."] = "Piel, garra y abrigo, {name}. Lo salvaje viaja ligero, pero completo."
L["Anything that bites you now gets a mouthful, {name}."] = "Quien te muerda se llevará un bocado de espinas, {name}."
L["Let the boar charge, {name}. It'll leave with regrets and splinters."] = "Que cargue el jabalí, {name}. Se irá con remordimientos y astillas."
L["Like a rose, {name}: lovely to look at, a mistake to grab."] = "Como una rosa, {name}: bonita de ver, mala de agarrar."
L["Thorns, {name}. I grew them myself, so do be polite to them."] = "Espinas, {name}. Las cultivé yo, así que trátalas con educación."
L["Blessing of Kings, {name}. No crown, no throne, no taxes owed."] = "Bendición de reyes, {name}. Sin corona, sin trono y sin impuestos."
L["Long may you reign, {name}. For the next while, anyway."] = "Larga vida a tu reinado, {name}. Al menos durante un rato."
L["A little more of everything, {name}. Kings never did settle for less."] = "Un poco más de todo, {name}. Los reyes nunca se conformaron con menos."
L["A king's blessing, {name}. Worn by better heads than mine, and some worse."] = "Bendición de rey, {name}. La lucieron cabezas mejores que la mía, y peores."
L["Every strength a little higher, {name}. Kings like to hedge their bets."] = "Todo un poco más alto, {name}. Los reyes nunca apuestan a una sola carta."
L["Crown not included, {name}. Everything else is, a little."] = "Corona no incluida, {name}. Lo demás sí, un poquito."
L["Might doesn't make right, {name}, but it does help the argument."] = "El poderío no da la razón, {name}, pero ayuda a discutir."
L["A firmer swing for you, {name}. The Light loves a good follow-through."] = "Golpes más firmes para ti, {name}. La Luz adora un buen remate."
L["Stronger arms, {name}. Kindly point them at something that deserves it."] = "Brazos más fuertes, {name}. Apúntalos, por favor, a algo que se lo merezca."
L["Blessing of Might, {name}. It'll surprise you. It'll surprise them far more."] = "Bendición de poderío, {name}. Te sorprenderá. A ellos, mucho más."
L["Swing away, {name}. The Light will take the credit if it goes well."] = "Tú dale, {name}. Si sale bien, la Luz se llevará el mérito."
L["Hit harder, {name}. Them, I mean. Not me. Never the paladin."] = "Pega más fuerte, {name}. A ellos, digo. A mí no. Al paladín, nunca."
L["Wisdom for you, {name}. I kept a little back for myself. Very little."] = "Sabiduría para ti, {name}. Me guardé un poco. Muy poquito."
L["Wisdom for your mana, {name}. The other kind still comes from bad decisions."] = "Sabiduría para tu maná, {name}. La otra se sigue sacando de las malas decisiones."
L["Your mana creeps back on its own now, {name}, like a cat that's forgiven you."] = "Tu maná vuelve solo, {name}, como un gato que ya te perdonó."
L["Fewer sips between fights, {name}. The innkeepers will be heartbroken."] = "Menos sorbos entre combates, {name}. Los posaderos quedarán destrozados."
L["Drink less, cast more, {name}. The Light's own budget advice."] = "Bebe menos y lanza más, {name}. Consejo de ahorro de la Luz."
L["Blessing of Wisdom, {name}: the one blessing that pays for itself."] = "Bendición de sabiduría, {name}: la única que se paga sola."
L["A blessing of quiet, {name}. Monsters will forget whose fault it was."] = "Bendición de calma, {name}. Los monstruos olvidarán quién fue."
L["Blessing of Salvation, {name}. You are now somebody else's problem."] = "Bendición de salvación, {name}. Ahora eres problema de otro."
L["Saved, {name}. Not your soul, mind. Just your hide."] = "Salvación, {name}. Del alma no, ojo. Del pellejo."
L["Hit hard, {name}. If anything turns round, look innocent. The Light will."] = "Pega fuerte, {name}. Si algo se gira, pon cara de inocente. La Luz lo hará."
L["The Light will find you easier now, {name}. Try not to squint."] = "Ahora la Luz te ve mejor, {name}. No entrecierres los ojos."
L["Holy Light lands harder on you now, {name}. Please don't make me prove it."] = "Luz Sagrada te cura más ahora, {name}. Por favor, no me obligues a demostrarlo."
L["You'll heal easier, {name}. The Light appreciates a willing patient."] = "Sanarás mejor, {name}. La Luz agradece a los pacientes dóciles."
L["Blessing of Light, {name}. Saving you is simpler now. Not that you'll need it."] = "Bendición de Luz, {name}. Salvarte será más fácil. No es que haga falta."
L["Block a blow now, {name}, and the Light hits back for you. It's petty."] = "Bloquea un golpe, {name}, y la Luz lo devuelve por ti. Es algo rencorosa."
L["Every blow lands softer now, {name}. Complaints go to the Light."] = "Ahora cada golpe te llega más suave, {name}. Las quejas, a la Luz."
L["All the shelter of a temple, {name}, and none of the roof repairs."] = "Todo el cobijo de un templo, {name}, y sin arreglar goteras."
L["Claim sanctuary, {name}. It's easier when you bring your own."] = "Pide santuario, {name}. Es más fácil si lo traes de casa."
L["Instructions, {name}: hit things harder. There is no page two."] = "Instrucciones, {name}: pega más fuerte. No hay página dos."
L["Your sword arm is sorted, {name}. For the rest of you, see a priest."] = "Brazo de la espada, listo, {name}. Para lo demás, un sacerdote."
L["Battle Shout, {name}. Not a spell, really. A strongly worded suggestion."] = "Grito de batalla, {name}. No es un hechizo. Es una sugerencia muy enérgica."
L["RAAAGH! That one was for you, {name}. Everyone else just overheard."] = "¡RAAAGH! Ese era para ti, {name}. Los demás solo lo oyeron de rebote."
L["A little breath from the damned, {name}. They weren't using it."] = "Un poco de aliento de los condenados, {name}. No lo estaban usando."
L["Unending Breath, {name}. The fish will have so many questions."] = "Respiración interminable, {name}. Los peces tendrán muchas preguntas."
L["Stay down as long as you like, {name}. Something else is holding its breath."] = "Bucea lo que quieras, {name}. Otra cosa contiene la respiración por ti."
L["Swim deep, {name}. If a murloc asks, you're only visiting."] = "Bucea hondo, {name}. Si un múrloc pregunta, estás de visita."
L["Folk will think we're duelling, {name}. Thanks for the {gift}."] = "Van a pensar que nos batimos en duelo, {name}. Gracias por {gift}."
L["{gift} for {buff}. No auctioneer's cut, {name}."] = "{gift} por {buff}. Sin comisión de subasta, {name}."
L["Beaten to it, {name}! Your {gift} was quicker than my manners."] = "¡Te me adelantaste, {name}! {gift} llegó antes que mis modales."
L["{gift} in, {buff} out. Finest economy in all Azeroth."] = "Entra {gift}, sale {buff}. La mejor economía de Azeroth."
L["{gift}, for me? All I have is this, {name}, but it's heartfelt."] = "¿{gift} para mí? Solo tengo esto, {name}, pero es de corazón."
L["Your {gift} fits perfectly, {name}. Did you measure me?"] = "Tu {gift} me sienta de maravilla, {name}. ¿Me tomaste medidas?"
L["A treaty in spells, {name}: {gift} for {buff}."] = "Un tratado mágico, {name}: {gift} por {buff}."
L["{gift}! I feel taller already. Have some {buff}."] = "¡{gift}! Ya me siento crecer. Toma, un poco de {buff}."
L["I was about to ask for {gift}, {name}. You read my mind."] = "Iba a pedirte {gift}, {name}. Me leíste la mente."
L["Your {gift} still fizzes, {name}. Here's some fizz back."] = "Tu {gift} aún chisporrotea, {name}. Van chispas de vuelta."
L["Such a kind {gift}, {name}. I'll tell the whole inn. Twice."] = "Qué {gift} tan amable, {name}. Lo contaré en la posada. Dos veces."
L["You cast {gift} first, {name}? My mother would despair of me."] = "¿Tú primero con {gift}, {name}? Mi madre me regañaría."
L["I'll remember your {gift} fondly, {name}. Until it wears off."] = "Recordaré tu {gift} con cariño, {name}. Hasta que se acabe."
L["{gift} for {buff}, free. Somewhere, a goblin weeps."] = "{gift} por {buff}, gratis. Algún goblin está llorando."
L["Your {gift}, my {buff}. We'll be unbearable now."] = "Tu {gift}, mi {buff}. Ahora vamos a ser insoportables."
L["Thanks for the {gift}, {name}. I'll earn it before it fades."] = "Gracias por {gift}, {name}. Haré méritos antes de que se acabe."
L["For {gift} I'd hand you both moons, {name}. This'll have to do."] = "Por {gift} te daría las dos lunas, {name}. Conténtate con esto."
L["You brought {gift}, I brought {buff}. Now it's a party."] = "Tú trajiste {gift}, yo traigo {buff}. Esto ya es una fiesta."
L["{gift}! I just had three clever thoughts, {name}. This was one."] = "¡{gift}! Se me ocurrieron tres ideas geniales, {name}. Esta es una."
L["With {gift}, {name}, I finally understand my own notes. Thanks."] = "Con {gift}, {name}, por fin entiendo mis propios apuntes. Gracias."
L["Cleverer already, {name}. Clever enough to know I owe you one. Here."] = "Ya pienso mejor, {name}. Lo bastante para saber que te debo una. Toma."
L["{gift}, {name}? I'll stand at the front for once. Briefly."] = "¿{gift}, {name}? Por una vez me pondré delante. Un ratito."
L["Knees, elbows and pride, {name}: all fortified. Thank you."] = "Rodillas, codos y orgullo, {name}: todo reforzado. Gracias."
L["Hit me now, {name}. Actually, don't. But thank you; I'd survive it."] = "Pégame ahora, {name}. Bueno, mejor no. Pero gracias: lo aguantaría."
L["{gift}! My spirits are lifted, {name}. Literally, it seems."] = "¡{gift}! Se me eleva el espíritu, {name}. Y literalmente."
L["I feel twice as calm and half as grumpy, {name}. Thank you."] = "Tengo el doble de calma y la mitad de mal humor, {name}. Gracias."
L["Shadow-proof, thanks to you, {name}. The whispers are furious."] = "A prueba de sombras gracias a ti, {name}. Los susurros, furiosos."
L["Nothing dark gets in now, {name}. Here's something bright going the other way."] = "Ya no entra nada oscuro, {name}. Aquí va algo luminoso en sentido contrario."
L["{gift}! A squirrel just nodded at me, {name}. Here's yours."] = "¡{gift}! Una ardilla me saludó, {name}. Aquí tienes lo tuyo."
L["Tougher hide, sharper senses, {name}. I may have to fight the urge to forage."] = "Piel más dura, sentidos más finos, {name}. Qué ganas de buscar bayas."
L["I feel all wild and leafy, {name}. Thank you. Sorry if I shed bark."] = "Me noto salvaje y con brotes, {name}. Gracias. Perdona si suelto corteza."
L["{gift}, {name}! Nobody's hugging me today. Have this instead."] = "¡{gift}, {name}! Hoy nadie me va a abrazar. Toma esto a cambio."
L["Prickly now, thanks to you, {name}. More than usual, I mean."] = "Ahora pincho gracias a ti, {name}. Más de lo normal, digo."
L["{gift} from you, {name}? I'll try not to found a dynasty."] = "¿{gift} de tu parte, {name}? Intentaré no fundar una dinastía."
L["A little better at everything, {name}. Is this how kings feel? No wonder."] = "Un poco mejor en todo, {name}. ¿Así se sienten los reyes? Ahora lo entiendo."
L["Stronger arms already, {name}. I'll try not to hug anyone. Thank you."] = "Brazos más fuertes, {name}. Intentaré no abrazar a nadie. Gracias."
L["With {gift} I could lift a kodo, {name}. I won't, but thank you."] = "Con {gift} podría levantar un kodo, {name}. No lo haré, pero gracias."
L["{gift} from you, {name}, and my first wise act is this."] = "{gift} de tu parte, {name}, y mi primer acto sabio es este."
L["Wiser already, {name}. Wise enough to know a kindness when I see one."] = "Ya tengo más sabiduría, {name}. La suficiente para reconocer un buen gesto."
L["{gift}! The monsters forgot me at once, {name}. I won't."] = "¡{gift}! Los monstruos ya me olvidaron, {name}. Yo a ti, no."
L["Nothing wants to fight me now, {name}. It's lovely. Thank you."] = "Ya nada quiere pelear conmigo, {name}. Es precioso. Gracias."
L["The Light finds me easier now, {name}. It says thank you, and so do I."] = "La Luz me encuentra mejor, {name}. Te da las gracias, y yo también."
L["Easier to heal now, thanks to you, {name}. My healer thanks you too."] = "Me curarán mejor gracias a ti, {name}. Mi sanador también lo agradece."
L["Blows land softer on me now, {name}. My bruises thank you, and so do I."] = "Ahora los golpes duelen menos, {name}. Mis chichones y yo te lo agradecemos."
L["Every hit gentler, thanks to you, {name}. I'll make sure they notice."] = "Cada golpe, más suave gracias a ti, {name}. Me aseguraré de que lo noten."
L["You shouted at me, {name}, and I've never felt so encouraged. Here."] = "Me gritaste, {name}, y nunca había tenido tanto ánimo. Toma."
L["My ears are ringing, {name}, and my arms feel twice as strong. Thank you!"] = "Me zumban los oídos, {name}, y mis brazos, el doble de fuertes. ¡Gracias!"
L["I can breathe underwater, {name}! I may never need to, but thank you."] = "¡Puedo respirar bajo el agua, {name}! Quizá nunca lo necesite, pero gracias."
L["Lungs like a murloc, thanks to you, {name}. Mrgl. Sorry. Thank you."] = "Pulmones de múrloc gracias a ti, {name}. Mrgl. Perdón. Gracias."
L["We have to stop meeting like this, {name}. Actually, no, we don't."] = "Tenemos que dejar de vernos así, {name}. Bueno, no, qué va."
L["Again, {name}? Splendid. I've been practising since last time."] = "¿Otra vez, {name}? Espléndido. Practiqué desde la última vez."
L["You again, {name}? People will start saying we're friends."] = "¿Tú otra vez, {name}? La gente dirá que somos uña y carne."
L["Same face, same spell, {name}. I do love a tradition."] = "Misma cara, mismo hechizo, {name}. Adoro las tradiciones."
L["Another round, {name}? I'm keeping score, and we're both winning."] = "¿Otra ronda, {name}? Llevo el marcador, y vamos ganando tú y yo."
L["Ah, {name}! My favourite repeat customer."] = "¡Ah, {name}! Mi cliente más fiel."
L["Our paths keep crossing, {name}. I think the road is dropping hints."] = "Siempre nos cruzamos, {name}. El camino me está lanzando indirectas."
L["Hello again, {name}. Do stop me if you've heard this one."] = "Hola de nuevo, {name}. Si este ya te lo sabes, me paras."
L["I kept some aside, {name}, in case you came back. Good instinct, mine."] = "Te guardé un poco, {name}, por si volvías. Buen instinto el mío."
L["Back already, {name}? I'm starting to think you like me."] = "¿Ya de vuelta, {name}? Empiezo a pensar que te caigo bien."
L["{name}, at this point we should just share a reagent pouch."] = "{name}, a estas alturas, compartamos bolsa de componentes."
L["Same time tomorrow, {name}? I'll bring {buff}. You bring you."] = "¿Mañana a la misma hora, {name}? Yo traigo {buff}. Tú te traes a ti."
L["I've lost count, {name}, and I've decided that's a compliment."] = "Perdí la cuenta, {name}, y decidí que eso es un cumplido."
L["Keep this up, {name}, and the bards will write a very dull song about us."] = "Si seguimos así, {name}, los bardos nos escribirán una canción muy aburrida."
L["I could do this one in my sleep by now, {name}. I may have."] = "Ya podría hacerlo en sueños, {name}. Puede que lo haya hecho."
L["{name}, the usual? Of course the usual. It's always the usual."] = "{name}, ¿lo de siempre? Claro. Siempre es lo de siempre."
L["We ought to have a secret handshake by now, {name}. Next time, perhaps."] = "Ya deberíamos tener un saludo secreto, {name}. Quizá la próxima vez."
L["By now, {name}, I think we've built a small economy between us."] = "A estas alturas, {name}, tú y yo ya somos una pequeña economía."
L["Old friends by now, {name}. Well, old acquaintances with excellent timing."] = "Amistad de toda la vida, {name}. Bueno, de un rato, pero muy bien sincronizada."
L["Let the record show: {name} and I, undefeated at being prepared."] = "Que conste en acta: {name} y yo, imbatibles en preparación."
L["Safe walls, warm beds, and now {buff}. You're spoiled, {name}."] = "Murallas, camas calientes y ahora {buff}. Qué vida de lujo, {name}."
L["The guards have it covered, {name}, but I like to be thorough."] = "Hay guardias, {name}, pero toda precaución es poca."
L["Careful, {name}. Look this capable in town and folk will ask you favours."] = "Cuidado, {name}. Con esa pinta de capaz, en la ciudad te pedirán favores."
L["Not a monster for miles, {name}. Still, one never knows about the cooking."] = "Ni un monstruo a la redonda, {name}. Pero con la comida de aquí, nunca se sabe."
L["For the crowds, {name}. In town, they're the real danger."] = "Por el gentío, {name}. En la ciudad, el peligro de verdad."
L["Rest easy, {name}. I'll count that my good deed and go find a pint."] = "Descansa, {name}. Buena obra del día hecha; me voy a tomar algo."
L["Even in town, {name}, a dragon has been known to drop in. Better safe."] = "Hasta en la ciudad, {name}, alguna vez aterrizó un dragón. Más vale prevenir."
L["Best do it in here, {name}. Out there, nobody stands still long enough."] = "Mejor aquí dentro, {name}. Ahí fuera nadie se está quieto lo suficiente."
L["Out here everything wants to eat you, {name}. Now it'll need a bigger fork."] = "Aquí fuera todo quiere comerte, {name}. Ahora necesitará un tenedor más grande."
L["No guards for miles, {name}, and the boars know it. Take this."] = "Ni un guardia a la redonda, {name}, y los jabalíes lo saben. Toma."
L["Nobody out here but us and the wildlife, {name}. Let's be the tougher half."] = "Aquí solo estamos nosotros y la fauna, {name}. Seamos la mitad más dura."
L["If a bear asks, {name}, you were like this when I found you."] = "Si un oso pregunta, {name}, ya estabas así cuando te encontré."
L["The wolves have been eyeing you, {name}. This should give them pause."] = "Los lobos te echaron el ojo, {name}. Con esto se lo pensarán."
L["Wild country, {name}. Best not to meet it armed with good intentions alone."] = "Tierras salvajes, {name}. Mejor no enfrentarlas solo con buenas intenciones."
L["Map, canteen, {buff}. Now you can get lost properly, {name}."] = "Mapa, cantimplora, {buff}. Ya puedes perderte bien, {name}."
L["Camp's a long way off, {name}. Consider this a roof you can carry."] = "El campamento queda lejos, {name}. Considera esto un techo portátil."
L["Somewhere in here a villain is rehearsing a speech, {name}. Let's interrupt."] = "Aquí dentro un villano ensaya su discurso, {name}. Vamos a interrumpirlo."
L["Whatever waits at the end of this place, {name}, let's make it regret it."] = "Lo que nos espere al final, {name}, que se arrepienta."
L["They say nobody leaves here alive, {name}. Let's be rude and prove them wrong."] = "Dicen que nadie sale vivo de aquí, {name}. Seamos maleducados y desmintámoslo."
L["Our host had years to prepare, {name}. We have {buff}."] = "El jefe tuvo años para prepararse, {name}. Nosotros, {buff}."
L["Nobody builds a dungeon with a back door, {name}. Take this instead."] = "Ninguna mazmorra tiene puerta trasera, {name}. Toma esto a cambio."
L["Dark halls, old traps, worse tempers. At least you're ready, {name}."] = "Salas oscuras, trampas viejas, peor genio. Al menos tú vas a punto, {name}."
L["Better I hand you this now, {name}, than a eulogy later."] = "Mejor darte esto ahora, {name}, que un elogio fúnebre después."
L["There's treasure in here, {name}, and something very large sat on it."] = "Aquí hay un tesoro, {name}, y algo enorme sentado encima."
L["Flags, towers, graveyards, {name}. Whatever we're fighting over, take this."] = "Banderas, torres, cementerios, {name}. Sea por lo que sea, toma esto."
L["Win or lose, {name}, nobody will say you went in unprepared."] = "Ganes o pierdas, {name}, nadie dirá que entraste sin prepararte."
L["The graveyard's just over there, {name}. Let's both not visit it."] = "El cementerio está ahí mismo, {name}. Mejor no lo visitemos."
L["Honour's on the line, {name}. So is the flag. Mostly the flag."] = "Está en juego el honor, {name}. Y la bandera. Sobre todo la bandera."
L["Stay with the group, {name}. Lone heroes end up in the other side's songs."] = "Quédate con el grupo, {name}. Al héroe solitario le cantan en el otro bando."
L["Early bird, {name}? Here's something better than a worm."] = "¿Madrugando, {name}? A quien madruga, yo le ayudo."
L["Good morning, {name}. Consider this your first cup of something strong."] = "Buenos días, {name}. Considera esto tu primera taza de algo bien cargado."
L["Early start, {name}. The day hasn't had a chance to go wrong yet."] = "Qué temprano, {name}. El día aún no tuvo tiempo de torcerse."
L["Not even lunch yet, {name}, and you're already better prepared than I am."] = "Ni siquiera es la hora de comer, {name}, y ya vas más a punto que yo."
L["Morning, {name}. Somewhere, the monsters are still yawning."] = "Buenos días, {name}. En algún lugar, los monstruos aún bostezan."
L["A fresh day and a fresh {buff}, {name}. Let's not waste either."] = "Día nuevo y {buff} de estreno, {name}. No desperdiciemos ninguno."
L["Out this late, {name}? The night is hungrier than the day. Take this."] = "¿Por ahí a estas horas, {name}? La noche tiene más hambre que el día. Toma."
L["Past bedtime, {name}. The sensible folk are asleep, which leaves us."] = "Hora de dormir, {name}. La gente sensata duerme; quedamos tú y yo."
L["Can't sleep either, {name}? Then let's be well-protected insomniacs."] = "¿Tampoco puedes dormir, {name}? Pues al menos, un insomnio bien protegido."
L["Mind the dark, {name}. Not everything out there is as friendly as I am."] = "Cuidado con la oscuridad, {name}. No todo ahí fuera es tan amable como yo."
L["It's late, {name}. This should keep you going till the sun remembers us."] = "Es tarde, {name}. Con esto aguantarás hasta que el sol se acuerde de nosotros."
L["Only the owls and us awake, {name}, and the owls get no {buff}."] = "Solo velamos tú, yo y los búhos, {name}. Y los búhos, sin {buff}."
L["Takes one to know one, {name}. Takes one to do it properly, too."] = "Hay que ser del gremio para verlo, {name}. Y para hacerlo bien."
L["From one of our trade to another, {name}. No need to check my work."] = "De profesional a profesional, {name}. No hace falta revisarlo."
L["Professional courtesy, {name}. We don't charge each other."] = "Cortesía profesional, {name}. Entre colegas no nos cobramos."
L["Two of a kind, {name}. Between us we could write the manual."] = "Tal para cual, {name}. Entre tú y yo podríamos escribir el manual."
L["Don't look so surprised, {name}. Same trainer, I expect."] = "¿Sorpresa, {name}? Seguro que tuvimos el mismo instructor."
L["I'd critique your technique, {name}, but mine looks exactly the same."] = "Criticaría tu técnica, {name}, pero la mía es idéntica."
L["Don't tell the others, {name}, but ours really is the finest calling."] = "No se lo digas a los demás, {name}, pero la nuestra es la mejor vocación."
L["Look at us, {name}. Two experts, making it look easy. It isn't, is it?"] = "Míranos, {name}: dos profesionales haciendo que parezca fácil. No lo es, ¿eh?"
L["I'd shout some encouragement, {name}, but you do that far better."] = "Te gritaría ánimos, {name}, pero eso tú lo haces mucho mejor."
L["Charge in as usual, {name}. I'll simply feel better about it now."] = "Carga como siempre, {name}. Ahora, al menos, lo veré con más calma."
L["For the one who goes in first, {name}. Somebody has to, and it's never me."] = "Para quien entra primero, {name}. Alguien tiene que hacerlo, y nunca soy yo."
L["You take the hits so the rest of us don't, {name}. It's the least I can do."] = "Te llevas los golpes por los demás, {name}. Es lo mínimo que puedo hacer."
L["Go on, {name}, charge. I'll be right behind you. Quite a long way behind."] = "Vamos, {name}, carga. Yo voy justo detrás. Bastante detrás."
L["Save the bubble for later, {name}. This one's from me."] = "Guárdate la burbuja para luego, {name}. Esta va de mi parte."
L["You bless everyone else all day, {name}. Here's one going the other way."] = "Te pasas el día bendiciendo a todos, {name}. Aquí va una en sentido contrario."
L["The Light already likes you, {name}. Consider this a second opinion."] = "La Luz ya te aprecia, {name}. Considera esto una segunda opinión."
L["Even the Light's own champion needs a hand now and then, {name}."] = "Hasta quien lucha por la Luz necesita ayuda a veces, {name}."
L["I'd ask for a blessing back, {name}, but then we'd be here all day."] = "Te pediría una bendición, {name}, pero no acabaríamos nunca."
L["One for you, {name}, and a pat on the head for your companion."] = "Esto para ti, {name}, y una caricia para tu mascota."
L["You watch everyone's back from range, {name}. I've got yours."] = "Cubres a todos desde lejos, {name}. Yo te cubro a ti."
L["Hunter's Mark for them, {buff} for you, {name}. Much nicer."] = "Marca del cazador para ellos, {buff} para ti, {name}. Mucho mejor."
L["Aim true, {name}. And if it charges you anyway, run towards the rest of us."] = "Apunta bien, {name}. Y si aun así te embiste, corre hacia nosotros."
L["Your pet was looking at me hopefully, {name}. This is for you; tell it sorry."] = "Tu mascota me miraba con ilusión, {name}. Esto es para ti; dile que lo siento."
L["For the one I never see coming, {name}. Meant as the highest praise."] = "Para quien nunca veo venir, {name}. Es el mayor de los elogios."
L["Quick, {name}, before you vanish again."] = "Rápido, {name}, antes de que te esfumes."
L["Poison on the blades, {buff} on you. Very thorough, {name}."] = "Veneno en las hojas y {buff} en ti. No se te escapa nada, {name}."
L["I'd slip it in your pocket, {name}, but you'd notice. You always notice."] = "Te lo metería en el bolsillo, {name}, pero lo notarías. Siempre lo notas."
L["For the one who opens every locked box, {name}. This one comes unlocked."] = "Para quien abre todas las cajas cerradas, {name}. Esta viene abierta."
L["For once, {name}, somebody's looking after the priest."] = "Por una vez, {name}, alguien cuida de quien cura."
L["Save your prayers for the rest of us, {name}. This one's already answered."] = "Guarda tus plegarias para los demás, {name}. Esta ya está respondida."
L["Light or Shadow, {name}, I don't ask which. This suits both."] = "Luz o Sombra, {name}, no pregunto. Esto sirve para las dos."
L["Sit down after this fight, {name}. That's an order, from a grateful patient."] = "Siéntate tras este combate, {name}. Es una orden de tus pacientes."
L["You keep us all standing, {name}. Here's a little of it coming back."] = "Nos mantienes en pie a todos, {name}. Aquí te devuelvo un poco."
L["No voice in your head comes with this one, {name}. Refreshing, isn't it?"] = "Esto no viene con ninguna voz en tu cabeza, {name}. Qué alivio, ¿verdad?"
L["The Ebon Blade asks no favours, {name}. I'm giving one anyway."] = "La Espada de Ébano no pide favores, {name}. Yo te hago uno igual."
L["A little warmth, {name}. I know you don't feel the cold. It's the thought."] = "Un poco de calor, {name}. Sé que no sientes el frío. Es el detalle."
L["You came back from the dead, {name}. The least I can do is help you stay back."] = "Volviste de entre los muertos, {name}. Lo mínimo es ayudarte a no volver allí."
L["Runes, plague and frost, {name}. Take this too; it completes the set."] = "Runas, peste y escarcha, {name}. Toma esto también; completa la colección."
L["The elements look after you, {name}, but they don't make house calls."] = "Los elementos te cuidan, {name}, pero no hacen visitas a domicilio."
L["Tell the spirits I said hello, {name}. They never write back."] = "Saluda a los espíritus de mi parte, {name}. Nunca me contestan."
L["Plant a totem in my honour, {name}. A small one. I'm modest."] = "Planta un tótem en mi honor, {name}. Uno pequeñito. Soy humilde."
L["Earth, fire, water, air and me, {name}. Admittedly the least of the five."] = "Tierra, fuego, agua, aire y yo, {name}. Lo reconozco: yo soy lo de menos."
L["Totems up already, {name}? Then this goes next to them. Don't plant it."] = "¿Ya pusiste los tótems, {name}? Pues esto va al lado. No lo plantes."
L["A gift for a mage, {name}? Like bringing water to... well, you."] = "¿Un regalo a un mago, {name}? Como llevarle agua a... bueno, a ti."
L["You solve most problems with sheep, {name}. This covers the rest."] = "Casi todo lo arreglas con ovejas, {name}. Esto cubre el resto."
L["You could teleport out of any trouble, {name}. This is for the trouble first."] = "Podrías teletransportarte fuera de cualquier lío, {name}. Esto es para antes."
L["For the clever one, {name}. Please don't thank me by making me a sheep."] = "Para la mente brillante, {name}. No me lo agradezcas volviéndome oveja."
L["Blink wherever you like, {name}. This comes too."] = "Trasládate adonde quieras, {name}. Esto va contigo."
L["Entirely demon-free, {name}. I checked."] = "Sin demonios, {name}. Lo comprobé."
L["Your imp may be jealous, {name}. Tell it there's plenty to go round."] = "Puede que tu diablillo tenga celos, {name}. Dile que hay para todos."
L["No contract, no fine print, {name}. Just a gift."] = "Sin contrato ni letra pequeña, {name}. Solo un regalo."
L["For the one who hands out healthstones, {name}. Nobody ever thanks you."] = "Para quien reparte piedras de salud, {name}. Nadie te da nunca las gracias."
L["Here, {name}. Summon the rest of us later and we'll call it even."] = "Toma, {name}. Luego nos invocas a los demás y estamos en paz."
L["Roll wherever you like, {name}. This rolls with you."] = "Rueda adonde quieras, {name}. Esto rueda contigo."
L["Brew first or fight first, {name}? Either way, take this."] = "¿Primero cerveza o pelea, {name}? Sea como sea, toma."
L["Inner peace for you, {name}, and outer peace too, as long as this lasts."] = "Paz interior para ti, {name}, y exterior también, mientras dure esto."
L["Chi flows better with a little help, {name}. Or so a monk once told me."] = "El chi fluye mejor con un poco de ayuda, {name}. O eso me dijo un monje."
L["Kick, flip, roll, {name}. I'll just stand here and do this bit."] = "Patada, voltereta, rueda, {name}. Yo me quedo aquí y hago esta parte."
L["Tell the bear this is for them too, {name}."] = "Dile al oso que esto también es para él, {name}."
L["Hold still, {name}. I've never once managed to catch you as a cheetah."] = "No te muevas, {name}. Nunca consigo alcanzarte cuando eres guepardo."
L["Nature looks after you already, {name}. Today she sent me to help."] = "La naturaleza ya te cuida, {name}. Hoy me mandó a echar una mano."
L["Whatever shape you're in next, {name}, this goes with you."] = "Tengas la forma que tengas después, {name}, esto va contigo."
L["For the forest's friend, {name}. Give my regards to the trees."] = "Para quien cuida del bosque, {name}. Saluda a los árboles."
L["You were not prepared, {name}. Now you are."] = "Nadie estaba preparado, {name}. Ahora tú sí."
L["Ten thousand years in a cell, {name}. You've earned a small kindness."] = "Diez mil años en una celda, {name}. Te mereces un pequeño detalle."
L["You gave up so much to fight the Legion, {name}. Here's a little back."] = "Diste tanto por luchar contra la Legión, {name}. Aquí te devuelvo algo."
L["For the one who leaps first, {name}. Do land somewhere friendly."] = "Para quien salta primero, {name}. Intenta aterrizar en terreno amigo."
L["Fel and fury, {name}, and now a little kindness. It'll balance out."] = "Energía vil y furia, {name}, y ahora un poco de bondad. Ya se compensará."
L["For you, {name}. Please don't breathe on it."] = "Para ti, {name}. Y no le eches el aliento."
L["A little help for a dragon, {name}. I'll be telling my grandchildren."] = "Una ayudita para un dragón, {name}. Se lo contaré a mis nietos."
L["The Aspects sent you out into the world, {name}. I'm making it friendlier."] = "Los Aspectos te enviaron al mundo, {name}. Yo lo hago un poco más amable."
L["Take to the skies after this, {name}. I'll wave from down here."] = "Alza el vuelo después, {name}. Yo te saludo desde abajo."
L["A dragon on our side, {name}. I've never felt safer being generous."] = "Un dragón de nuestro lado, {name}. Nunca dar fue tan buena inversión."
L["{buff} for a mage, {name}. Like lending a library a book."] = "{buff} entre magos, {name}: como llevar libros a una biblioteca."
L["Mage to mage, {name}: I won't ask you for water if you won't ask me."] = "Entre magos, {name}: yo no te pido agua si tú no me la pides."
L["Two mages, {name}. Between us we can portal anywhere and still be late."] = "Dos magos, {name}: portales a todas partes y aun así llegamos tarde."
L["A mage for a mage, {name}. The Kirin Tor would call this peer review."] = "Entre colegas, {name}. El Kirin Tor lo llamaría revisión por pares."
L["Priest to priest, {name}: who blesses the blessers? Today, me."] = "Entre sacerdotes, {name}: ¿quién bendice a los que bendicen? Hoy, yo."
L["Between us priests, {name}, we'll both pretend the tank listens."] = "Aquí entre sacerdotes, {name}: finjamos que el tanque nos hace caso."
L["A priest looking after a priest, {name}. It feels almost forbidden."] = "Cuidar de quien cuida, {name}. Casi parece prohibido."
L["Two priests, {name}. Twice the praying and half the panic."] = "Dos sacerdotes, {name}: doble de plegarias, mitad de pánico."
L["Two druids, {name}. The Cenarion Circle would call this a quorum."] = "Dos druidas, {name}. El Círculo Cenarion lo llamaría quórum."
L["Druid to druid, {name}: bear or cat, I'd know you by the leaves in your hair."] = "De druida a druida, {name}: oso o gato, te reconocería por las hojas del pelo."
L["From one shapeshifter to another, {name}: this one fits every shape."] = "De cambiaformas a cambiaformas, {name}: esto sirve para todas las formas."
L["No handshake, {name}. Two druids, and neither of us has the right shape for it."] = "Nada de apretón de manos, {name}: dos druidas y ni una forma con manos."
L["Paladin to paladin, {name}: I won't mention the bubble if you don't."] = "Entre paladines, {name}: yo no saco lo de la burbuja si tú tampoco."
L["A blessing for a paladin, {name}. Now we're both insufferably radiant."] = "Bendición para quien bendice, {name}. Ahora brillamos sin piedad."
L["Two paladins, {name}. Somewhere, a priest is quietly relieved."] = "Dos paladines, {name}. Algún sacerdote respira aliviado."
L["One of us should be humble about this, {name}. Neither of us will be."] = "Alguien debería mostrar humildad aquí, {name}. Y no seremos ni tú ni yo."
L["Warlock to warlock, {name}: keep your imp away from mine. They gossip."] = "Entre brujos, {name}: aleja tu diablillo del mío. Son unos chismosos."
L["Fellow warlock, {name}? Then you know this one's actually harmless. Honestly."] = "¿Colega de brujería, {name}? Entonces sabes que esto es inofensivo. De verdad."
L["Two warlocks, {name}. Let's not compare soul shards in public."] = "Dos brujos, {name}. No comparemos fragmentos de alma en público."
L["Between us, {name}, the demons do all the work. This bit I do myself."] = "Entre tú y yo, {name}, los demonios hacen todo el trabajo. Esto lo hago yo."
L["Two warriors, {name}. Somewhere, a healer just sighed."] = "Dos guerreros, {name}. Algún sanador acaba de suspirar."
L["Warrior to warrior, {name}: first into the fight buys the drinks. I'm buying."] = "Entre guerreros, {name}: quien entre primero paga la ronda. Invito yo."
L["Shout for shout, {name}. We'll deafen the whole place together."] = "Grito a grito, {name}. Dejaremos sordo a todo el lugar."
L["No plan, {name}? Perfect. We'll get along."] = "¿Sin plan, {name}? Perfecto. Nos llevaremos bien."
L["Aye, {name}, ye only had to ask. Hold still now!"] = "¡Pues claro, {name}, bastaba con pedirlo! ¡No te menees!"
L["Here, {name}, a wee somethin' to keep ye on yer feet."] = "Aquí tienes, {name}, algo pa' que no flaquees."
L["My thanks, {name}. Allow me to return the kindness."] = "Te lo agradezco, {name}. Permíteme devolverte la cortesía."
L["Of course, {name}. Stand fast a moment."] = "Por supuesto, {name}. Aguanta un momento."
L["The road ahead is long, {name}. Take this with you."] = "Te espera un largo camino, {name}. Llévate esto."
L["Ishnu-alah, {name}. Your kindness is returned."] = "Ishnu-alah, {name}. Te devuelvo tu bondad."
L["Elune-adore, {name}. Walk softly beneath the stars."] = "Elune-adore, {name}. Camina con sigilo bajo las estrellas."
L["The Light rewards kindness, {name}, and so shall I."] = "La Luz recompensa la bondad, {name}, y yo también."
L["Of course, {name}. May the Naaru guide your steps."] = "Por supuesto, {name}. Que los naaru guíen tus pasos."
L["The Light is with you, {name}. Go in peace."] = "La Luz está contigo, {name}. Ve en paz."
L["Much obliged, {name}. Gilneas never forgets a kindness."] = "Mil gracias, {name}. Gilneas nunca olvida un favor."
L["Lok'tar ogar, {name}! Take this into battle."] = "¡Lok'tar ogar, {name}! Llévate esto a la batalla."
L["The Earth Mother sees your kindness, {name}. I return it."] = "La Madre Tierra ve tu bondad, {name}. Te la devuelvo."
L["Of course, {name}. Stand tall and be at peace."] = "Por supuesto, {name}. Alza la cabeza y ve en paz."
L["Walk with the Earth Mother, {name}."] = "Camina con la Madre Tierra, {name}."
L["Sure ting, {name}. Hold still now."] = "Claro que sí, {name}. No te mueva' ahora."
L["Da loa be watchin' over ya, {name}."] = "Los loa velan por ti, {name}."
L["Such courtesy does you credit, {name}. Anar'alah belore."] = "Tanta cortesía te honra, {name}. Anar'alah belore."
L["Anar'alah belore, {name}. May the sun guide you."] = "Anar'alah belore, {name}. Que el sol te guíe."
L["Your generosity is noted, {name}. Suramar remembers its friends."] = "Tomo nota de tu generosidad, {name}. Suramar recuerda a sus amigos."
L["Thank you, {name}! The caravan always repays a kindness."] = "¡Gracias, {name}! La caravana siempre devuelve un favor."
L["Every traveller needs something for the road, {name}."] = "Todo viajero necesita algo para el camino, {name}."
L["Of course, {name}. Patience, and it is done."] = "Por supuesto, {name}. Un poco de paciencia y listo."
L["Take this, {name}. Even a dragon needs allies."] = "Toma, {name}. Hasta un dragón necesita aliados."
L["Thank you, {name}. The Alliance looks after its own."] = "Gracias, {name}. La Alianza cuida de los suyos."
L["Of course, {name}. Allies help each other."] = "Por supuesto, {name}. Los aliados se ayudan."
L["For the Alliance, {name}! Stay strong out there."] = "¡Por la Alianza, {name}! Mantente fuerte ahí fuera."
L["Strength and honour, {name}. Your kindness is repaid."] = "Fuerza y honor, {name}. Tu bondad queda pagada."
L["Consider it done, {name}. For the Horde."] = "Considéralo hecho, {name}. Por la Horda."
L["For the Horde, {name}! Go with strength."] = "¡Por la Horda, {name}! Ve con fuerza."
L["Thank you, {name}. Good hearts are found everywhere."] = "Gracias, {name}. Hay buenos corazones en todas partes."
L["Gladly, {name}, whatever banner you fly."] = "Con gusto, {name}, sea cual sea tu estandarte."
L["Friends can come from any side, {name}."] = "Hay amigos en todos los bandos, {name}."
L["Safe travels, {name}. Take some {buff} with you."] = "Buen viaje, {name}. Llévate {buff} contigo."
